lick Submit\";i:3130;s:126:\"For more information about configuring Relay Response in the Merchant Interface, please see the %sMerchant Integration Guide%s\";i:3131;s:33:\"Return URL after Successful order\";i:3132;s:66:\"The URL where visitor will be redirected after completing payment.\";i:3133;s:80:\"For example, a URL to your site that displays a %s\"Thank you for the payment\"%s.\";i:3134;s:29:\"Return URL after Failed order\";i:3135;s:70:\"The URL where the visitor will be redirected after completing payment.\";i:3136;s:81:\"For example, the URL to your website that displays a %s\"Payment Canceled\"%s page.\";i:3137;s:29:\"Automatically approve booking\";i:3138;s:89:\"Check this box to automatically approve booking, when visitor makes a successful payment.\";i:3139;s:7:\"Warning\";i:3140;s:59:\"This will not work, if the visitor leaves the payment page.\";i:3141;s:11:\"%s Settings\";i:3142;s:42:\"Integration of authorizenet payment system\";i:3143;s:195:\"If you have no account on this system, please sign up for a %sdeveloper test account%s to obtain an API Login ID and Transaction Key. These keys will authenticate requests to the payment gateway.\";i:3144;s:99:\"Please configure all fields inside the %sBilling form fields%s section at %sPayments General%s tab.\";i:3145;s:36:\"%s - Server Integration Method (SIM)\";i:3146;s:42:\"Payment for booking %s on these day(s): %s\";i:3147;s:13:\"Merchant Code\";i:3148;s:32:\"Enter your iPay88 Merchant Code.\";i:3149;s:12:\"Merchant Key\";i:3150;s:31:\"Enter your iPay88 Merchant Key.\";i:3151;s:17:\"Malaysian Ringgit\";i:3152;s:16:\"Philippine Pesos\";i:3153;s:36:\"Automatically approve/cancel booking\";i:3154;s:170:\"Check this box to automatically approve bookings, when visitor makes a successful payment, or automatically cancel the booking, when visitor makes a payment cancellation.\";i:3155;s:18:\"Successful payment\";i:3156;s:26:\" Parameters are incorrect,\";i:3157;s:22:\"Cannot find the record\";i:3158;s:16:\"Amount different\";i:3159;s:14:\"Payment failed\";i:3160;s:46:\"Payment status updated by Mobile88 Admin(Fail)\";i:3161;s:16:\"Connection Error\";i:3162;s:36:\"Integration of iPay88 payment system\";i:3163;s:16:\"Payment rejected\";i:3164;s:13:\"Please pay %s\";i:3165;s:21:\"Chose payment account\";i:3166;s:4:\"TEST\";i:3167;s:4:\"LIVE\";i:3168;s:15:\"Publishable key\";i:3169;s:10:\"Secret key\";i:3170;s:32:\"Integration of %s payment system\";i:3171;s:32:\"require PHP version %s or newer!\";i:3172;s:69:\"If you have no account on this system, please visit %s to create one.\";i:3173;s:28:\"Pay using %s payment service\";i:3174;s:11:\"Vendor Name\";i:3175;s:89:\"Set this value to the Vendor Name assigned to you by Sage Pay or chosen when you applied.\";i:3176;s:23:\"XOR Encryption password\";i:3177;s:73:\"Set this value to the XOR Encryption password assigned to you by Sage Pay\";i:3178;s:64:\"Select TEST for the Test Server and LIVE in the live environment\";i:3179;s:9:\"SIMULATOR\";i:3180;s:91:\"This can be DEFERRED or AUTHENTICATED if your Sage Pay account supports those payment types\";i:3181;s:7:\"PAYMENT\";i:3182;s:8:\"DEFERRED\";i:3183;s:12:\"AUTHENTICATE\";i:3184;s:3:\"Yen\";i:3185;s:18:\"Australian Dollars\";i:3186;s:11:\"Swiss Franc\";i:3187;s:13:\"Swedish Krona\";i:3188;s:12:\"Danish Krone\";i:3189;s:12:\"Polish Zloty\";i:3190;s:15:\"Norwegian Krone\";i:3191;s:16:\"Hungarian Forint\";i:3192;s:12:\"Czech Koruna\";i:3193;s:14:\"Israeli Shekel\";i:3194;s:12:\"Mexican Peso\";i:3195;s:41:\"Brazilian Real (only for Brazilian users)\";i:3196;s:45:\"Malaysian Ringgits (only for Malaysian users)\";i:3197;s:18:\"Taiwan New Dollars\";i:3198;s:9:\"Thai Baht\";i:3199;s:4:\"Sage\";i:3200;s:34:\"Integration of Sage payment system\";i:3201;s:75:\"Payment method description that the customer will see on your payment page.\";i:3202;s:13:\"Bank Transfer\";i:3203;s:43:\"Integration of Bank Transfer payment system\";i:3204;s:15:\"Account details\";i:3205;s:49:\"Allow payments by %sdirect bank / wire transfer%s\";i:3206;s:36:\"Its only show fixed payment details.\";i:3207;s:9:\"Sort Code\";i:3208;s:148:\"Dear %sMake your payment %s directly into our bank account. %sPlease use your Booking ID %s as the payment reference! %s %s: %s %s: %s %s: %s %s: %s\";i:3209;s:14:\"Account Number\";i:3210;s:4:\"IBAN\";i:3211;s:11:\"BIC / Swift\";i:3212;s:12:\"Account Name\";i:3213;s:9:\"Bank Name\";i:3214;s:3:\"BSB\";i:3215;s:19:\"Bank Transit Number\";i:3216;s:4:\"IFSC\";i:3217;s:11:\"Branch Sort\";i:3218;s:9:\"Bank Code\";i:3219;s:14:\"Routing Number\";i:3220;s:11:\"Branch Code\";i:3221;s:60:\"You can use following shortcodes in content of this template\";i:3222;s:40:\"%s - inserting all bank accounts details\";i:3223;s:27:\"%s - inserting account name\";i:3224;s:29:\"%s - inserting account number\";i:3225;s:25:\"%s - inserting bank name \";i:3226;s:25:\"%s - inserting sort code \";i:3227;s:20:\"%s - inserting IBAN \";i:3228;s:19:\"%s - inserting BIC \";i:3229;s:36:\"%s - inserting the cost of  booking \";i:3230;s:105:\"You can use any shortcodes, that you can use in payment description form at Settings Payment General page\";i:3231;s:13:\"+ Add Account\";i:3232;s:26:\"Remove selected account(s)\";i:3233;s:9:\"for 1 day\";i:3234;s:11:\"for 1 night\";i:3235;s:9:\"fixed sum\";i:3236;s:10:\"for 1 hour\";i:3237;s:12:\"Set the cost\";i:3238;s:32:\" Select your cost configuration.\";i:3239;s:19:\"Time impact to cost\";i:3240;s:182:\"Check this box if you want that specific additional cost, which configured as percentage for some option, apply to other additional fixed costs and not only to original booking cost.\";i:3241;s:51:\"Do not show payment form, after submit booking form\";i:3242;s:63:\"Auto send payment request after creation booking in admin panel\";i:3243;s:44:\"Show deposit and total booking cost together\";i:3244;s:98:\"Check this box if you want to show deposit amount and total booking cost, after submit of booking.\";i:3245;s:9:\"Important\";i:3246;s:192:\"Please note, at admin panel for booking will be saved deposit cost and notes about deposit, do not depend from the visitor choice of this payment. You need to check each such payment manually!\";i:3247;s:26:\"Send email on cost changes\";i:3248;s:117:\"Check this box if you want to send booking modification email, if cost of booking was edited in booking listing page.\";i:3249;s:8:\"Currency\";i:3250;s:117:\"This is default currency that showing at your website. Specific payment gateway(s) can support or does not suport it.\";i:3251;s:63:\"Check and configure currency at each activated payment gateway.\";i:3252;s:17:\"Currency Position\";i:3253;s:36:\"Set position of the currency symbol.\";i:3254;s:4:\"Left\";i:3255;s:5:\"Right\";i:3256;s:15:\"Left with space\";i:3257;s:16:\"Right with space\";i:3258;s:24:\"Number of decimal points\";i:3259;s:12:\"No separator\";i:3260;s:5:\"Space\";i:3261;s:3:\"Dot\";i:3262;s:5:\"Comma\";i:3263;s:31:\"Separator for the decimal point\";i:3264;s:19:\"Thousands separator\";i:3265;s:13:\"Please select\";i:3266;s:129:\"Please select a field from your booking form. This field will be automatically assigned to the current field in the billing form.\";i:3267;s:14:\"Customer Email\";i:3268;s:13:\"First Name(s)\";i:3269;s:9:\"Last name\";i:3270;s:15:\"Billing Address\";i:3271;s:12:\"Billing City\";i:3272;s:9:\"Post Code\";i:3273;s:5:\"State\";i:3274;s:36:\"Show booking details in payment form\";i:3275;s:56:\"Configure booking details summary above the payment form\";i:3276;s:8:\"Payments\";i:3277;s:23:\"Customizaton of Payment\";i:3278;s:16:\"Payment Gateways\";i:3279;s:7:\"General\";i:3280;s:16:\"Payment Settings\";i:3281;s:35:\"Payment Gateways - General Settings\";i:3282;s:23:\"Active Payment Gateways\";i:3283;s:19:\"Billing form fields\";i:3284;s:15:\"Payment Options\";i:3285;s:19:\"Payment Description\";i:3286;s:11:\"Pay in Cash\";i:3287;s:7:\"Gateway\";i:3288;s:71:\"Some currencies at payment gateways are different from main currency %s\";i:3289;s:164:\"Interface of plugin is using %s currency. Specific payment gateway will use own currency in payment form without currency exchange! Its can be reason of wrong cost.\";i:3290;s:40:\"Use these shortcodes for customization: \";i:3291;s:13:\"ID of booking\";i:3292;s:23:\"ID of booking resources\";i:3293;s:11:\"website URL\";i:3294;s:10:\"IP of user\";i:3295;s:26:\"browser user agent of user\";i:3296;s:11:\"request URL\";i:3297;s:12:\"current date\";i:3298;s:12:\"current time\";i:3299;s:26:\"URL to manage this booking\";i:3300;s:24:\"URL to edit this booking\";i:3301;s:26:\"URL to cancel this booking\";i:3302;s:33:\"URL of payment request of booking\";i:3303;s:20:\"HASH of this booking\";i:3304;s:28:\"content data of this booking\";i:3305;s:18:\"show amount to pay\";i:3306;s:18:\"total booking cost\";i:3307;s:12:\"deposit cost\";i:3308;s:12:\"balance cost\";i:3309;s:21:\"original booking cost\";i:3310;s:23:\"additional booking cost\";i:3311;s:11:\"Merchant ID\";i:3312;s:28:\"Enter your iDEAL Merchant ID\";i:3313;s:30:\"Enter your iDEAL Merchant Key.\";i:3314;s:90:\"Test mode requires the option %s to be selected in the %s account configuration section %s\";i:3315;s:19:\"Test with Simulator\";i:3316;s:25:\"My Profile – Connection\";i:3317;s:197:\"If not supplied then the description as configured in the administration/management portal section will be used. If the option %s is selected then the configured description will always be applied.\";i:3318;s:22:\"Always use Description\";i:3319;s:38:\"Processing your %s payments through %s\";i:3320;s:41:\"Integration of Pay in Cash payment system\";i:3321;s:67:\"If you accept %scash payment%s, you can write details about it here\";i:3322;s:89:\"Dear %sPay in cash %s for your booking %s on check in %sFor reference your booking ID: %s\";i:3323;s:54:\"Make payments with payPal - its fast, free and secure!\";i:3324;s:15:\"Paypal Standard\";i:3325;s:26:\"Paypal Pro Hosted Solution\";i:3326;s:12:\"Account Type\";i:3327;s:40:\"Paypal Email address to receive payments\";i:3328;s:18:\"Secure Merchant ID\";i:3329;s:122:\" Indicates whether the transaction is payment on a final sale or an authorization for a final sale, to be captured later. \";i:3330;s:4:\"Sale\";i:3331;s:13:\"Authorization\";i:3332;s:69:\" Select using test (Sandbox Test Environment) or live PayPal payment.\";i:3333;s:86:\"PayPal sandbox can be used to test payments. Sign up for a developer account %shere%s.\";i:3334;s:7:\"Sandbox\";i:3335;s:13:\"British Pound\";i:3336;s:12:\"Japanese Yen\";i:3337;s:18:\"Israeli New Shekel\";i:3338;s:39:\"Turkish Lira (only for Turkish members)\";i:3339;s:19:\"Custom button title\";i:3340;s:19:\"Payment Button type\";i:3341;s:24:\"Show Payment description\";i:3342;s:58:\"Check this box to show payment description in payment form\";i:3343;s:23:\"Show Reference Text Box\";i:3344;s:41:\"Check this box to show Reference Text Box\";i:3345;s:23:\"Enter your phone number\";i:3346;s:24:\"Reference Text Box Title\";i:3347;s:96:\"Enter a title for the Reference text box (i.e. Your email address). Visitors will see this text.\";i:3348;s:22:\"Return URL from PayPal\";i:3349;s:29:\"Cancel Return URL from PayPal\";i:3350;s:35:\"Follow these steps to configure it:\";i:3351;s:30:\"Log in to your PayPal account.\";i:3352;s:25:\"Click the Profile subtab.\";i:3353;s:67:\"Click Website Payment Preferences in the Seller Preferences column.\";i:3354;s:66:\"Under Auto Return for Website Payments, click the On radio button.\";i:3355;s:90:\"For the Return URL, enter the Return URL from PayPal on your site for successfull payment.\";i:3356;s:114:\"Instant Payment Notification (IPN) is a message service that notifies you of events related to PayPal transactions\";i:3357;s:38:\"Sending email for verified transaction\";i:3358;s:37:\"Sending email for invalid transaction\";i:3359;s:48:\"Sending email if error occur during verification\";i:3360;s:18:\"Use SSL connection\";i:3361;s:76:\"Use the SSL connection for posting data, instead of standard HTTP connection\";i:3362;s:16:\"Use cURL posting\";i:3363;s:62:\"Use the cURL for posting data, instead of fsockopen() function\";i:3364;s:74:\" Follow these instructions to set up your listener at your PayPal account:\";i:3365;s:36:\"Click Profile on the My Account tab.\";i:3366;s:81:\"Click Instant Payment Notification Preferences in the Selling Preferences column.\";i:3367;s:82:\"Click Choose IPN Settings to specify your listeners URL and activate the listener.\";i:3368;s:67:\"Specify the URL for your listener in the Notification URL field as:\";i:3369;s:61:\"Click Receive IPN messages (Enabled) to enable your listener.\";i:3370;s:11:\"Click Save.\";i:3371;s:86:\"Click Back to Profile Summary to return to the Profile after activating your listener.\";i:3372;s:6:\"PayPal\";i:3373;s:36:\"Integration of Paypal payment system\";i:3374;s:10:\"PayPal IPN\";i:3375;s:9:\"Error IPN\";i:3376;s:12:\"Verified IPN\";i:3377;s:11:\"Invalid IPN\";i:3378;s:14:\"Search results\";i:3379;s:8:\"Book now\";i:3380;s:19:\"Search availability\";i:3381;s:15:\"Search results.\";i:3382;s:14:\"Nothing found.\";i:3383;s:15:\"Result(s) Found\";i:3384;s:22:\"Title of search widget\";i:3385;s:23:\"Title of search results\";i:3386;s:21:\"Nothing found message\";i:3387;s:21:\"URL of Search Results\";i:3388;s:6:\"coupon\";i:3389;s:8:\"discount\";i:3390;s:8:\"Superior\";i:3391;s:18:\"Presidential Suite\";i:3392;s:7:\"Coupons\";i:3393;s:28:\"Setting coupons for discount\";i:3394;s:23:\"Add New Discount Coupon\";i:3395;s:11:\"Coupon Code\";i:3396;s:7:\"Savings\";i:3397;s:12:\"Minimum Cost\";i:3398;s:10:\"Expiration\";i:3399;s:4:\"Year\";i:3400;s:5:\"Month\";i:3401;s:3:\"Day\";i:3402;s:15:\"Number of usage\";i:3403;s:18:\"Enter coupon code.\";i:3404;s:44:\"Enter number of fixed or percentage savings.\";i:3405;s:15:\"Expiration Date\";i:3406;s:37:\"Select Expiration Date of the coupon.\";i:3407;s:20:\"Minimum Booking Cost\";i:3408;s:54:\"Enter minimum booking cost, when coupon is applicable.\";i:3409;s:23:\"Maximum number of usage\";i:3410;s:57:\"Enter maximum number of times, when coupon is applicable.\";i:3411;s:70:\"Select booking resources, where is possible to apply this coupon code.\";i:3412;s:50:\"Example: %s - custom number of visitor selections\"\";i:3413;s:22:\"HTML tags is accepted.\";i:3414;s:7:\"hour(s)\";i:3415;s:16:\"Cache expiration\";i:3416;s:31:\"Select time of cache expiration\";i:3417;s:13:\"Cache Updated\";i:3418;s:24:\"Search Availability Form\";i:3419;s:14:\"Search Results\";i:3420;s:12:\"Search Cache\";i:3421;s:77:\"CSS customization of search form and search results you can make at this file\";i:3422;s:15:\"Select Template\";i:3423;s:27:\"Inline Search Form Template\";i:3424;s:31:\"Horizontal Search Form Template\";i:3425;s:29:\"Standard Search Form Template\";i:3426;s:30:\"Reset Search Availability Form\";i:3427;s:49:\"Found: %s booking forms inside of posts or pages \";i:3428;s:18:\"Reset Search Cache\";i:3429;s:113:\"Use \"Check In\" date as available in calendar for booking resources with capacity higher then 1 for search results\";i:3430;s:110:\"Use \"Check Out\" date as available in calendar for booking resources with capacity higher then 1 search results\";i:3431;s:28:\"Show availability in tooltip\";i:3432;s:135:\"Check this box to display the available number of booking resources with a tooltip, when mouse hovers over each day on the calendar(s).\";i:3433;s:11:\"Available: \";i:3434;s:18:\"Availability Title\";i:3435;s:29:\"Use pending days as available\";i:3436;s:104:\"Auto Cancel all pending bookings for the specific date(s), if some booking is approved for these date(s)\";i:3437;s:40:\"Set capacity based on number of visitors\";i:3438;s:68:\"Please read more info about configuration of this parameter %shere%s\";i:3439;s:127:\"Add tooltip on calendar(s) to show availability based on the number of available booking resource items remaining for each day.\";i:3440;s:139:\"Be sure to match the maximum number of visitors for the %sone booking resource%s with the number of visitors specified on the booking form.\";i:3441;s:156:\"Display tooltip on calendar(s) to show availability based on total (fixed) number of visitors for the resource, which can be at free booking resource items.\";i:3442;s:136:\"Be sure to match the maximum number of visitors for %sall booking resources%s with the number of visitors specified on the booking form.\";i:3443;s:47:\"Disable bookings in different booking resources\";i:3444;s:92:\"Check this box to dissable reservations, which can be stored in different booking resources.\";i:3445;s:99:\"When checked, all reserved days must be at same booking resource otherwise error message will show.\";i:3446;s:12:\"Max visitors\";i:3447;s:13:\"Form Settings\";i:3448;s:30:\"Customization of Form Settings\";i:3449;s:14:\"Delete booking\";i:3450;s:8:\"Actions:\";i:3451;s:15:\"Min / Max cost:\";i:3452;s:21:\"Reason of Cancelation\";i:3453;s:8:\"Max Cost\";i:3454;s:3:\"Any\";i:3455;s:8:\"Specific\";i:3456;s:12:\"General Info\";i:3457;s:15:\"Standard Fields\";i:3458;s:15:\"Advanced Fields\";i:3459;s:11:\"Bla bla bla\";i:3460;s:14:\"Section Header\";i:3461;s:8:\"Bookings\";i:3462;s:4:\"week\";i:3463;s:5:\"weeks\";i:3464;s:5:\"month\";i:3465;s:6:\"months\";i:3466;s:32:\"Filter bookings by booking dates\";i:3467;s:13:\"Current dates\";i:3468;s:5:\"Today\";i:3469;s:14:\"Previous dates\";i:3470;s:9:\"All dates\";i:3471;s:18:\"Today check in/out\";i:3472;s:19:\"Check In - Tomorrow\";i:3473;s:20:\"Check Out - Tomorrow\";i:3474;s:4:\"Next\";i:3475;s:5:\"Prior\";i:3476;s:8:\"Check-in\";i:3477;s:9:\"Check-out\";i:3478;s:4:\"Tada\";i:3479;s:9:\"Help info\";i:3480;s:12:\"About Plugin\";i:3481;s:17:\"Technical Support\";i:3482;s:17:\"Calendar Overview\";i:3483;s:172:\"Probably you updated your paid version of Booking Calendar by free version or update process failed. You can request the new update of your paid version at %1sthis page%2s.\";i:3484;s:30:\"Don\'t show the message anymore\";i:3485;s:222:\".ics - is a file format of iCalendar standard for exchanging calendar and scheduling information between different sources %s Using a common calendar format (.ics), you can keep all your calendars updated and synchronized.\";i:3486;s:44:\"and any other calendar that uses .ics format\";i:3487;s:13:\"Calendar Skin\";i:3488;s:39:\"Select the skin of the booking calendar\";i:3489;s:8:\"month(s)\";i:3490;s:7:\"year(s)\";i:3491;s:16:\"Number of months\";i:3492;s:52:\"Select the maximum number of months to show (scroll)\";i:3493;s:21:\"Start Day of the week\";i:3494;s:33:\"Select your start day of the week\";i:3495;s:21:\"Unavailable week days\";i:3496;s:83:\"Check unavailable days in calendars. This option will overwrite all other settings.\";i:3497;s:27:\"Unavailable days from today\";i:3498;s:63:\"Select number of unavailable days in calendar start from today.\";i:3499;s:6:\"Simple\";i:3500;s:117:\"Check the box, if you want to use simple booking form customization from Free plugin version at Settings - Form page.\";i:3501;s:58:\"Check the box to activate CAPTCHA inside the booking form.\";i:3502;s:16:\"Auto-fill fields\";i:3503;s:68:\"Check the box to activate auto-fill form fields for logged in users.\";i:3504;s:17:\"Use CSS BootStrap\";i:3505;s:39:\"Using BootStrap CSS for the form fields\";i:3506;s:86:\"You must not deactivate loading BootStrap files at advanced section of these settings!\";i:3507;s:26:\"Show legend below calendar\";i:3508;s:71:\"Check this box to display a legend of dates below the booking calendar.\";i:3509;s:14:\"Available item\";i:3510;s:9:\"Available\";i:3511;s:60:\"Activate and type your %stitle of available%s item in legend\";i:3512;s:12:\"Pending item\";i:3513;s:58:\"Activate and type your %stitle of pending%s item in legend\";i:3514;s:13:\"Approved item\";i:3515;s:6:\"Booked\";i:3516;s:59:\"Activate and type your %stitle of approved%s item in legend\";i:3517;s:21:\"Partially booked item\";i:3518;s:16:\"Partially booked\";i:3519;s:67:\"Activate and type your %stitle of partially booked%s item in legend\";i:3520;s:75:\"Partially booked item - day, which is booked for the specific time-slot(s).\";i:3521;s:26:\"Show date number in legend\";i:3522;s:61:\"Check this box to display today date number in legend cells. \";i:3523;s:24:\"Show \"Thank You\" message\";i:3524;s:42:\"Redirect visitor to a new \"Thank You\" page\";i:3525;s:66:\"This action will have no effect, if the payment form(s) is active!\";i:3526;s:28:\"Action after booking is done\";i:3527;s:100:\"Thank you for your online booking. %s We will send confirmation of your booking as soon as possible.\";i:3528;s:13:\"Message title\";i:3529;s:56:\"Type title of message %safter booking has done by user%s\";i:3530;s:23:\"Time of message showing\";i:3531;s:56:\"Set duration of time (milliseconds) to show this message\";i:3532;s:23:\"URL of \"thank you\" page\";i:3533;s:32:\"Type URL of %s\"Thank You\" page%s\";i:3534;s:16:\"Bookings Listing\";i:3535;s:26:\"Default booking admin page\";i:3536;s:69:\"Select your default view mode of bookings at the booking listing page\";i:3537;s:4:\"Week\";i:3538;s:8:\"2 Months\";i:3539;s:8:\"3 Months\";i:3540;s:26:\"Default calendar view mode\";i:3541;s:72:\"Select your default calendar view mode at booking calendar overview page\";i:3542;s:10:\"Filter tab\";i:3543;s:11:\"Actions tab\";i:3544;s:19:\"Default toolbar tab\";i:3545;s:65:\"Select your default opened tab in toolbar at booking listing page\";i:3546;s:24:\"Bookings number per page\";i:3547;s:53:\"Select number of bookings per page in booking listing\";i:3548;s:3:\"ASC\";i:3549;s:4:\"DESC\";i:3550;s:22:\"Bookings default order\";i:3551;s:60:\"Select your default order of bookings in the booking listing\";i:3552;s:11:\"Date Format\";i:3553;s:6:\"F j, Y\";i:3554;s:92:\"Type your date format for emails and the booking table. %sDocumentation on date formatting%s\";i:3555;s:15:\"Short days view\";i:3556;s:14:\"Wide days view\";i:3557;s:10:\"Dates view\";i:3558;s:55:\"Select the default view for dates on the booking tables\";i:3559;s:17:\"Show / hide hints\";i:3560;s:65:\"Check this box if you want to show help hints on the admin panel.\";i:3561;s:40:\"Allow unlimited bookings per same day(s)\";i:3562;s:213:\"Check this box, if you want to %sset any days as available%s in calendar. Your visitors will be able to make %sunlimited bookings per same date(s) in calendar and do not see any booked date(s)%s of other visitors.\";i:3563;s:61:\"Checking to prevent double booking, during submitting booking\";i:3564;s:102:\"Check this box, if you want to %sre-check if the selected dates available during submitting booking%s.\";i:3565;s:165:\"This feature useful to prevent double booking of the same date(s) or time(s), if several visitors try to book the same date(s) in same calendar during the same time.\";i:3566;s:79:\"This feature does not work for booking resources with capacity higher than one.\";i:3567;s:44:\"Show advanced settings of JavaScript loading\";i:3568;s:44:\"Hide advanced settings of JavaScript loading\";i:3569;s:38:\"Disable Bootstrap loading on Front-End\";i:3570;s:126:\" If your theme or some other plugin is load the BootStrap JavaScripts, you can disable  loading of this script by this plugin.\";i:3571;s:37:\"Disable Bootstrap loading on Back-End\";i:3572;s:44:\"Load JS and CSS files only on specific pages\";i:3573;s:78:\"Activate loading of CSS and JavaScript files of plugin only at specific pages.\";i:3574;s:61:\"Relative URLs of pages, where to load plugin CSS and JS files\";i:3575;s:156:\"Enter relative URLs of pages, where you have Booking Calendar elements (booking forms or availability calendars). Please enter one URL per line. Example: %s\";i:3576;s:43:\"Show system debugging log for beta features\";i:3577;s:51:\"Activate this option only for testing beta features\";i:3578;s:34:\"Show settings of powered by notice\";i:3579;s:34:\"Hide settings of powered by notice\";i:3580;s:17:\"Powered by notice\";i:3581;s:69:\" Turn On/Off powered by \"Booking Calendar\" notice under the calendar.\";i:3582;s:21:\"Help and info notices\";i:3583;s:71:\" Turn On/Off version notice and help info links at booking admin panel.\";i:3584;s:20:\"Plugin menu position\";i:3585;s:3:\"Top\";i:3586;s:6:\"Middle\";i:3587;s:6:\"Bottom\";i:3588;s:38:\"User permissions for plugin menu pages\";i:3589;s:11:\"Add booking\";i:3590;s:53:\"Select user access level for the menu pages of plugin\";i:3591;s:7:\"Premium\";i:3592;s:16:\"Show / hide menu\";i:3593;s:44:\"Delete booking data, when plugin deactivated\";i:3594;s:72:\"Check this box to delete all booking data when you uninstal this plugin.\";i:3595;s:29:\"Restore all dismissed windows\";i:3596;s:142:\"You allow unlimited number of bookings per same dates, its can be a reason of double bookings on the same date. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3597;s:86:\"This feature can impact to speed of submitting booking. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3598;s:118:\"You are need to be sure what you are doing. You are disable of loading some JavaScripts Do you really want to do this?\";i:3599;s:121:\"If you check this option, all booking data will be deleted when you uninstall this plugin. Do you really want to do this?\";i:3600;s:15:\"Booking Listing\";i:3601;s:68:\"Email Address will be used in the FROM field of response to Visitor.\";i:3602;s:30:\"Your booking has been approved\";i:3603;s:64:\"Type your email %ssubject%s for the booking confimation message.\";i:3604;s:103:\"Your reservation %s for: %s has been approved.%sYou can edit the booking on this page: %s Thank you, %s\";i:3605;s:57:\"Your booking %s for: %s has been approved.%sThank you, %s\";i:3606;s:175:\"For example: \"You have a new reservation %s on the following date(s): %s Contact information: %s You can approve or cancel this booking at: %s Thank you, Reservation service.\"\";i:3607;s:83:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor after approval of booking\";i:3608;s:51:\"Email is sent to Visitor after Approval of booking.\";i:3609;s:139:\"Email different from website DNS, its can be a reason of not delivery emails. Please use the email withing the same domain as your website!\";i:3610;s:30:\"Your booking has been declined\";i:3611;s:59:\"Your booking %s for: %s has been  canceled. %sThank you, %s\";i:3612;s:87:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor after Cancellation of booking\";i:3613;s:51:\"Email is sent to Visitor after Deleting of booking.\";i:3614;s:96:\"Customization of email template, which is sent to Visitor, when booking status is set to Pending\";i:3615;s:54:\"Email is sent to Visitor after booking set as Pending.\";i:3616;s:11:\"New booking\";i:3617;s:171:\"You need to approve a new booking %s for: %s Person detail information:%s Currently a new booking is waiting for approval. Please visit the moderation panel%sThank you, %s\";i:3618;s:3:\"New\";i:3619;s:5:\"admin\";i:3620;s:76:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Admin after new booking\";i:3621;s:52:\"Email is sending to Admin after creation of booking.\";i:3622;s:142:\"Your reservation %s for: %s is processing now! We will send confirmation by email. %sYou can edit this booking at this page: %s  Thank you, %s\";i:3623;s:99:\"Your reservation %s for: %s is processing now! We will send confirmation by email. %s Thank you, %s\";i:3624;s:7:\"visitor\";i:3625;s:78:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor after new booking\";i:3626;s:54:\"Email is sending to Visitor after creation of booking.\";i:3627;s:70:\"Email is sent to visitor after cancelling of booking (moved to trash).\";i:3628;s:22:\"Check Premium Features\";i:3629;s:26:\"Upgrade to higher versions\";i:3630;s:24:\"Form Field Configuration\";i:3631;s:21:\"Reset to default form\";i:3632;s:10:\"Form Field\";i:3633;s:4:\"View\";i:3634;s:14:\"Standard Forms\";i:3635;s:19:\"Form under calendar\";i:3636;s:30:\"Form at right side of calendar\";i:3637;s:30:\"Form and calendar are centered\";i:3638;s:24:\"Form for dark background\";i:3639;s:117:\"You can generate the form fields for your form (at the left side) by selection specific field in the above selectbox.\";i:3640;s:70:\"Please read more about the booking form fields configuration %shere%s.\";i:3641;s:349:\"You can reset your active form template by selecting default %sform template%s at the top toolbar. Please select the form template and click on %sReset%s button for resetting only active form (Booking Form or Content of Booking Fields form). Click  on %sBoth%s button if you want to reset both forms: Booking Form and Content of Booking Fields form.\";i:3642;s:33:\"Show / hide field in booking form\";i:3643;s:21:\"Set field as required\";i:3644;s:58:\"Type only %sunique field name%s, that is not using in form\";i:3645;s:6:\"Values\";i:3646;s:44:\"Enter dropdown options. One option per line.\";i:3647;s:4:\"feed\";i:3648;s:23:\"This feature require %s\";i:3649;s:77:\"This feature require %s plugin. You can install %s plugin from this %spage%s.\";i:3650;s:12:\"How it works\";i:3651;s:13:\".ics feed URL\";i:3652;s:41:\"Please enter URL for generating .ics feed\";i:3653;s:57:\"This .ics feed of bookings starting from today for 1 year\";i:3654;s:11:\"Event Title\";i:3655;s:48:\"Select field for assigning to %sevent property%s\";i:3656;s:34:\"Event Description (optional field)\";i:3657;s:8:\"Timezone\";i:3658;s:89:\"Select a city in your required timezone, if you are having problems with dates and times.\";i:3659;s:57:\"Use check in/out time of plugin, during import .ics feeds\";i:3660;s:20:\"Append check out day\";i:3661;s:89:\"Append one check out day, during import .ics feeds, if activated using check in/out times\";i:3662;s:51:\"Assign events fields to specific booking form field\";i:3663;s:5:\"feeds\";i:3664;s:22:\"Enter URL to .ics feed\";i:3665;s:11:\"Choose file\";i:3666;s:15:\"Insert file URL\";i:3667;s:16:\"Upload / Select \";i:3668;s:40:\"What does .ics feeds import/export mean?\";i:3669;s:84:\"Its useful, if you need to import/export bookings from/to external websites, like %s\";i:3670;s:42:\"How to start import of .ics feeds (files)?\";i:3671;s:18:\"Install %s plugin.\";i:3672;s:105:\"Insert %s shortcode into  some post(s) or page(s). Check more info about this %sshortcode configuration%s\";i:3673;s:249:\"Using such shortcodes in pages give a great flexibility to import from  different .ics feeds (sources) into the same resource.%sAlso  its possible to define different CRON parameters for accessing such different pages with  different time intervals.\";i:3674;s:61:\"Or you can import .ics feed or file directly at current page.\";i:3675;s:140:\"If you have inserted import shortcodes from %s, then  you can configure your CRON for periodically access these pages and import .ics feeds.\";i:3676;s:42:\"How to start export of .ics feeds (files)?\";i:3677;s:44:\"Configure ULR feed(s) at this settings page.\";i:3678;s:192:\"Using such URL(s) you can import .ics feeds, from  interface of other websites. %sCheck  more info  about how to import .ics feeds into other websites at the support pages of sepcific website.\";i:3679;s:79:\"Visit these (previously configured URL feeds) pages for downloading .ics files.\";i:3680;s:20:\"Activate auto import\";i:3681;s:81:\"Check this box to %sactivate%s auto import events and creation bookings from them\";i:3682;s:19:\"Import events every\";i:3683;s:40:\"Select time duration of import requests.\";i:3684;s:14:\"Google API Key\";i:3685;s:71:\"Please enter your Google API key. This field required to import events.\";i:3686;s:82:\"You can check in this %sinstruction how to generate and use your Google API key%s.\";i:3687;s:14:\"Maximum number\";i:3688;s:74:\"You can specify the maximum number of events to import during one session.\";i:3689;s:3:\"Now\";i:3690;s:11:\"00:00 today\";i:3691;s:21:\"Start of current week\";i:3692;s:22:\"Start of current month\";i:3693;s:20:\"End of current month\";i:3694;s:17:\"The start of time\";i:3695;s:20:\"Specific date / time\";i:3696;s:47:\"Select option, when to start retrieving events.\";i:3697;s:6:\"Offset\";i:3698;s:17:\"Enter date / time\";i:3699;s:7:\"seconds\";i:3700;s:93:\"You can specify an additional offset from you chosen start point. The offset can be negative.\";i:3701;s:40:\"Type your date in format %s. Example: %s\";i:3702;s:15:\"The end of time\";i:3703;s:5:\"Until\";i:3704;s:46:\"Select option, when to stop retrieving events.\";i:3705;s:61:\"To get Google Calendar API key please follow this instruction\";i:3706;s:35:\"Go to Google Developer Console: %s.\";i:3707;s:44:\"Give your project a name and click \"Create\".\";i:3708;s:38:\"In the sidebar click on \"APIs & auth\".\";i:3709;s:53:\"Click APIs and make sure \"Calendar API\" is set to ON.\";i:3710;s:42:\"Now click on \"Credentials\" in the sidebar.\";i:3711;s:72:\"Under the section \"Public API access\" click the button \"Create new Key\".\";i:3712;s:62:\"On the popup click the button \"Server Key\" and click \"Create\".\";i:3713;s:135:\"You will now see a table loaded with the top item being the API Key. Copy this and paste it into %sGoogle API Key%s field at this page.\";i:3714;s:27:\"Set Your Calendar to Public\";i:3715;s:34:\"Navigate to your Google calendars.\";i:3716;s:35:\"Open the settings for the calendar.\";i:3717;s:37:\"Click the \"Share this Calendar\" link.\";i:3718;s:74:\"Click the checkbox to make calendar public. Do not check the other option.\";i:3719;s:21:\"Find Your Calendar ID\";i:3720;s:151:\"Now copy the Calendar ID to use in the plugin settings in your WordPress admin. Make sure to %suse the Calendar ID only, not the entire XML feed URL%s.\";i:3721;s:29:\"Import Google Calendar Events\";i:3722;s:18:\"Auto import events\";i:3723;s:38:\"Default settings for retrieving events\";i:3724;s:34:\"Google Calendar - General Settings\";i:3725;s:19:\"Booking Admin Panel\";i:3726;s:28:\"Auto cancellation / approval\";i:3727;s:11:\"Plugin Menu\";i:3728;s:9:\"Uninstall\";i:3729;s:45:\"Auto cancellation / auto approval of bookings\";i:3730;s:11:\"Information\";i:3731;s:24:\"Uninstall / deactivation\";i:3732;s:12:\"Booking Data\";i:3733;s:13:\"Booking Dates\";i:3734;s:25:\"Show ALL dates of booking\";i:3735;s:28:\"Show only check in/out dates\";i:3736;s:18:\"Resource not exist\";i:3737;s:13:\"Move to trash\";i:3738;s:7:\"Restore\";i:3739;s:43:\"Do you really want to delete this booking ?\";i:3740;s:46:\"Do you really want to set booking as pending ?\";i:3741;s:3:\"Mon\";i:3742;s:3:\"Tue\";i:3743;s:3:\"Wed\";i:3744;s:3:\"Thu\";i:3745;s:3:\"Fri\";i:3746;s:3:\"Sat\";i:3747;s:3:\"Sun\";i:3748;s:7:\"Decline\";i:3749;s:3:\"Pay\";i:3750;s:16:\"Booking Calendar\";i:3751;s:11:\"Video guide\";i:3752;s:15:\"Getting Started\";i:3753;s:9:\"Help Info\";i:3754;s:13:\"Contact email\";i:3755;s:21:\"Rate plugin (thanks:)\";i:3756;s:15:\"Current version\";i:3757;s:4:\"Demo\";i:3758;s:7:\"Version\";i:3759;s:8:\"Used for\";i:3760;s:8:\"websites\";i:3761;s:7:\"website\";i:3762;s:12:\"Release date\";i:3763;s:24:\"Explore Premium Features\";i:3764;s:9:\"Statistic\";i:3765;s:27:\"New (unverified) booking(s)\";i:3766;s:18:\"Pending booking(s)\";i:3767;s:6:\"Agenda\";i:3768;s:25:\"New booking(s) made today\";i:3769;s:18:\"Bookings for today\";i:3770;s:23:\"Insert booking calendar\";i:3771;s:16:\"Booking calendar\";i:3772;s:16:\"Insert Shortcode\";i:3773;s:8:\"TimeLine\";i:3774;s:19:\"Resources Selection\";i:3775;s:9:\"Only Form\";i:3776;s:16:\"Insert into page\";i:3777;s:79:\"Select booking resources. Please use CTRL to select multiple booking resources.\";i:3778;s:9:\"View mode\";i:3779;s:26:\"Select type of view format\";i:3780;s:12:\"All bookings\";i:3781;s:26:\"Number of months to scroll\";i:3782;s:47:\"Select number of months to scroll after loading\";i:3783;s:24:\"Number of days to scroll\";i:3784;s:45:\"Select number of days to scroll after loading\";i:3785;s:10:\"Start Date\";i:3786;s:17:\"Select start date\";i:3787;s:44:\"Select number of month to show for calendar.\";i:3788;s:12:\"Start month:\";i:3789;s:30:\"Select start month of calendar\";i:3790;s:22:\"Show advanced settings\";i:3791;s:22:\"Hide advanced settings\";i:3792;s:82:\"Setting advanced parameters of the calendar. %sLike width, height and structure %s\";i:3793;s:90:\"%s or minimum and fixed number of days selection for the specific day of week or season.%s\";i:3794;s:80:\"Please read more about the possible customizations of these %soptions%s %shere%s\";i:3795;s:89:\"Specify the full width of calendar, height of date cell and number of months in one row. \";i:3796;s:131:\"Calendar have 2 months in a row, the cell height is 30px and calendar full width 568px (possible to use percentage for width: 100%)\";i:3797;s:12:\"Code Example\";i:3798;s:107:\"Specify that during certain seasons (or days of week), the specific minimum number of days must be booked. \";i:3799;s:102:\"Visitor can select only 4 days starting at Monday, 3 or 7 days – Friday, 2 days – Saturday, etc…\";i:3800;s:111:\"Please, read more about the shortcodes %shere%s or JavaScript customization of the specific shortcodes %shere%s\";i:3801;s:44:\"Aggregate booking dates from other resources\";i:3802;s:120:\"Select booking resources, for getting booking dates from them and set such dates as unavailable in destination calendar.\";i:3803;s:103:\"This shortcode %s is using for selection of the booking form of specific booking resources in selectbox\";i:3804;s:105:\"Select booking resources, for showing in selectbox. Please use CTRL to select multiple booking resources.\";i:3805;s:28:\"Define preselected resource.\";i:3806;s:27:\"Please select the resource:\";i:3807;s:27:\"Title near your select box.\";i:3808;s:26:\"Select shortcode to insert\";i:3809;s:11:\"Search form\";i:3810;s:51:\"Check this box to show search results on other page\";i:3811;s:22:\"URL of search results:\";i:3812;s:36:\"Type the URL of search results page.\";i:3813;s:24:\"Title of Search results:\";i:3814;s:33:\"Type the title of Search results.\";i:3815;s:29:\"show number of search results\";i:3816;s:22:\"Nothing Found Message:\";i:3817;s:37:\"Type the message, when nothing found.\";i:3818;s:22:\"Search only for users:\";i:3819;s:42:\"Type IDs of the users (separated by comma \";i:3820;s:149:\"This shortcode %s is using for showing the search results at specific page, if the search form is submit showing the search results at different page\";i:3821;s:23:\"Define date for booking\";i:3822;s:33:\"Show listing of customer bookings\";i:3823;s:32:\"Show info about Booking Resource\";i:3824;s:166:\"This shortcode %s is used on a page, where visitors can %smodify%s their own booking(s), %scancel%s or make %spayment%s after receiving an admin email payment request\";i:3825;s:109:\"The content of field %sURL to edit bookings%s on the %sgeneral booking settings page%s must link to this page\";i:3826;s:70:\"Email templates, which use shortcodes: %s, will be linked to this page\";i:3827;s:96:\"This shortcode %s is used on a page, where visitors can %sview listing%s of their own booking(s)\";i:3828;s:130:\"The content of field %sURL of page for customer bookings listing%s on the %sgeneral booking settings page%s must link to this page\";i:3829;s:72:\"%s You can use in this shortcode the same parameters as for %s shortcode\";i:3830;s:5:\"Trick\";i:3831;s:28:\"Select type of info to show.\";i:3832;s:23:\"Expand Advanced Toolbar\";i:3833;s:25:\"Collapse Advanced Toolbar\";i:3834;s:88:\"Send email notification to customer after approval, cancellation or deletion of bookings\";i:3835;s:14:\"Emails sending\";i:3836;s:10:\"Booking ID\";i:3837;s:2:\"Go\";i:3838;s:22:\"About Booking Calendar\";i:3839;s:23:\"Refresh booking listing\";i:3840;s:30:\"Reset filter to default values\";i:3841;s:8:\"Order by\";i:3842;s:5:\"Exist\";i:3843;s:8:\"In Trash\";i:3844;s:12:\"New bookings\";i:3845;s:8:\"Creation\";i:3846;s:25:\"Approve selected bookings\";i:3847;s:32:\"Set selected bookings as pending\";i:3848;s:31:\"Move selected bookings to trash\";i:3849;s:25:\"Restore selected bookings\";i:3850;s:24:\"Delete selected bookings\";i:3851;s:50:\"Do you really want to delete selected booking(s) ?\";i:3852;s:22:\"Reason of cancellation\";i:3853;s:8:\"Read All\";i:3854;s:25:\"Mark as read all bookings\";i:3855;s:4:\"Read\";i:3856;s:30:\"Mark as read selected bookings\";i:3857;s:6:\"Unread\";i:3858;s:32:\"Mark as Unread selected bookings\";i:3859;s:10:\"Show month\";i:3860;s:13:\"Show 3 months\";i:3861;s:9:\"Show year\";i:3862;s:8:\"Show day\";i:3863;s:9:\"Show week\";i:3864;s:13:\"Show 2 months\";i:3865;s:16:\"Previous 4 weeks\";i:3866;s:13:\"Previous week\";i:3867;s:12:\"Current week\";i:3868;s:9:\"Next week\";i:3869;s:12:\"Next 4 weeks\";i:3870;s:17:\"Previous 3 months\";i:3871;s:14:\"Previous month\";i:3872;s:13:\"Current month\";i:3873;s:10:\"Next month\";i:3874;s:13:\"Next 3 months\";i:3875;s:15:\"Previous 7 days\";i:3876;s:12:\"Previous day\";i:3877;s:11:\"Current day\";i:3878;s:8:\"Next day\";i:3879;s:11:\"Next 7 days\";i:3880;s:27:\"Number of months in one row\";i:3881;s:14:\"Calendar width\";i:3882;s:20:\"Calendar cell height\";i:3883;s:56:\"Send email notification to customer about this operation\";i:3884;s:22:\"Add to Google Calendar\";i:3885;s:5:\"Total\";i:3886;s:11:\"ID or Title\";i:3887;s:13:\"Email copy to\";i:3888;s:93:\"%sError!%s Request do not pass security check! Please refresh the page and try one more time.\";i:3889;s:13:\"Set as Unread\";i:3890;s:11:\"Set as Read\";i:3891;s:15:\"Set as Approved\";i:3892;s:14:\"Set as Pending\";i:3893;s:28:\"Reason for cancellation here\";i:3894;s:27:\"Reason of cancellation here\";i:3895;s:14:\"Moved to trash\";i:3896;s:8:\"Restored\";i:3897;s:33:\"The code you entered is incorrect\";i:3898;s:11:\"Updating...\";i:3899;s:6:\"Error!\";i:3900;s:105:\"Probably these date(s) just was booking by other visitor. Please reload this page and make booking again.\";i:3901;s:70:\"Email is sent to Visitor after Canceling of booking (moved to  trash).\";i:3902;s:173:\"Probabaly you updated your paid version of Booking Calendar by free version or update process failed. You can request the new update of your paid version at %1sthis page%2s.\";i:3903;s:13:\"Copy to admin\";i:3904;s:65:\"Enable / disable sending copy of this email notification to admin\";i:3905;s:86:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor after approval of booking\";i:3906;s:54:\"Email is sending to Visitor after Approval of booking.\";i:3907;s:90:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor after Cancellation of booking\";i:3908;s:54:\"Email is sending to Visitor after Deleting of booking.\";i:3909;s:99:\"Customization of email template, which is sending to Visitor, when booking status is set to Pending\";i:3910;s:57:\"Email is sending to Visitor after booking set as Pending.\";i:3911;s:73:\"Email is sending to Visitor after Canceling of booking (moved to  trash).\";i:3912;s:43:\"Confgure ULR feed(s) at this settings page.\";i:3913;s:6:\"Reject\";i:3914;s:78:\"Visit these (previosly configured URL feeds) pages for downloading .ics files.\";i:3915;s:15:\"Import Settings\";i:3916;s:14:\"does not exist\";i:3917;s:22:\"Calendar is loading...\";i:3918;s:88:\"Booking resource type is not defined. Its can be, when at the URL is wrong booking hash.\";i:3919;s:130:\"%sWarning! Booking calendar for this booking resource are already at the page, please check more about this issue at %sthis page%s\";i:3920;s:52:\"Wrong booking hash in URL. Probably hash is expired.\";i:3921;s:49:\"You do not set any parameters for booking editing\";i:3922;s:55:\"Please check more about configuration at  %sthis page%s\";i:3923;s:26:\"Booking form with calendar\";i:3924;s:26:\"Only availability calendar\";i:3925;s:6:\"Footer\";i:3926;s:30:\"Example: %sMake booking here%s\";i:3927;s:149:\"%sImportant!!!%s Please note, if you show booking calendar (inserted into post/page) with widget at the same page, then the last will not be visible.\";i:3928;s:53:\"%sSeveral widgets are supported at %spaid versions%s.\";i:3929;s:14:\"Importing Feed\";i:3930;s:12:\"Data Parsing\";i:3931;s:102:\"Some data was retrieved, but could not be parsed successfully. Please ensure your feed URL is correct.\";i:3932;s:74:\"The feed could not be found (404). Please ensure your feed URL is correct.\";i:3933;s:102:\"Access to this feed was denied (403). Please ensure you have public sharing enabled for your calendar.\";i:3934;s:93:\"The feed data could not be retrieved. Error code: %s. Please ensure your feed URL is correct.\";i:3935;s:3:\"GID\";i:3936;s:9:\"Selection\";i:3937;s:9:\"Location:\";i:3938;s:11:\"Reload page\";i:3939;s:26:\"Delete selected booking(s)\";i:3940;s:91:\"You can specify an additional offset from you chosen end point. The offset can be negative.\";i:3941;s:32:\"Retrieve Google Calendar Events \";i:3942;s:59:\"Please configure settings for import Google Calendar events\";i:3943;s:9:\"Configure\";i:3944;s:35:\"%s Found %s not indexed bookings %s\";i:3945;s:32:\"%s Finish getting sort dates. %s\";i:3946;s:19:\"Updated booking: %s\";i:3947;s:12:\"Booking form\";i:3948;s:98:\"This booking canceled because we did not receive payment and the administrator did not approve it.\";i:3949;s:14:\"Booking system\";i:3950;s:203:\"You can use (in subject and content of email template) any shortcodes, which you used in the booking form. Use the shortcodes in the same way as you used them in the content form at Settings Fields page.\";i:3951;s:108:\"%s - inserting data info about the booking, which you configured in the content form at Settings Fields page\";i:3952;s:42:\"%s - inserting data info about the booking\";i:3953;s:35:\"%s - inserting the dates of booking\";i:3954;s:56:\"%s - inserting check-in date (first day of reservation),\";i:3955;s:56:\"%s - inserting check-out date (last day of reservation),\";i:3956;s:43:\"%s - inserting the number of booking dates \";i:3957;s:29:\"%s - inserting ID of booking \";i:3958;s:55:\"%s or %s - inserting the title of the booking resource \";i:3959;s:29:\"%s - inserting your site URL \";i:3960;s:59:\"%s - inserting IP address of the user who made this action \";i:3961;s:92:\"%s - inserting contents of the User-Agent: header from the current request, if there is one \";i:3962;s:76:\"%s - inserting address of the page (if any), where visitor make this action \";i:3963;s:35:\"%s - inserting date of this action \";i:3964;s:35:\"%s - inserting time of this action \";i:3965;s:44:\"%s - inserting moderate link of new booking \";i:3966;s:159:\"%s - inserting link to the page where visitor can edit the reservation,  (possible to use the %s parameter for setting different %s of this page. Example: %s )\";i:3967;s:160:\"%s - inserting link to the page where visitor can cancel the reservation, (possible to use the %s parameter for setting different %s of this page. Example: %s )\";i:3968;s:165:\"%s - inserting link to payment page where visitor can pay for the reservation  (possible to use the %s parameter for setting different %s of this page. Example: %s )\";i:3969;s:80:\"%s - add the reason for booking payment, you can enter it before sending email, \";i:3970;s:82:\"%s - add the reason booking was cancelled, you can enter it before sending email, \";i:3971;s:34:\"Configuration in several languages\";i:3972;s:68:\"%s - start new translation section, where %s - locale of translation\";i:3973;s:49:\"Example #1: %s - start French translation section\";i:3974;s:65:\"Example #2: \"%s\" - English and French translation of some message\";i:3975;s:2:\"no\";i:3976;s:63:\"Warning! Some error occur, during sending registration request.\";i:3977;s:160:\"Please refresh this page and if the same error appear again contact support by email (with  info about order number and website) for finishing the registrations\";i:3978;s:72:\"If you like %s please leave us a %s rating. A huge thank you in advance!\";i:3979;s:14:\"Changes saved.\";i:3980;s:4:\"Prev\";i:3981;s:52:\"We&#8217;ve assembled some links to get you started:\";i:3982;s:11:\"Get Started\";i:3983;s:64:\"Insert booking form %sshortcode%s into your %sPost%s or %sPage%s\";i:3984;s:51:\"or add booking calendar %sWidget%s to your sidebar.\";i:3985;s:62:\"Check %show todo%s that and what %sshortcodes%s are available.\";i:3986;s:60:\"Add new booking from your post/page or from %sAdmin Panel%s.\";i:3987;s:10:\"Next Steps\";i:3988;s:48:\"Check %sBooking Listing%s page for new bookings.\";i:3989;s:31:\"Configure booking %sSettings%s.\";i:3990;s:49:\"Configure predefined set of your %sForm Fields%s.\";i:3991;s:46:\"Configure your predefined %sEmail Templates%s.\";i:3992;s:17:\"Have a questions?\";i:3993;s:22:\"Check out our %sHelp%s\";i:3994;s:12:\"See %sFAQ%s.\";i:3995;s:44:\"Still having questions? Contact %sSupport%s.\";i:3996;s:57:\"Need even more functionality? Check %s higher versions %s\";i:3997;s:29:\"This checkbox must be checked\";i:3998;s:36:\"At least one option must be selected\";i:3999;s:21:\"Incorrect email field\";i:4000;s:24:\"Your emails do not match\";i:4001;s:43:\"Please, select booking date(s) at Calendar.\";i:4002;s:8:\"Deleting\";i:4003;s:8:\"Updating\";i:4004;s:6:\"Saving\";i:4005;s:7:\"Booking\";i:4006;s:22:\"Action is not allowed!\";i:4007;s:38:\"Type your %savailability%s description\";i:4008;s:77:\"Check this box if you want to show the pending days as available in calendars\";i:4009;s:231:\"Warning!!! After you approved the specific booking(s), all your pending bookings of the same booking resource as an approved booking for the dates, which are intersect with dates of approved booking, will be automatically canceled!\";i:4010;s:108:\"Check this box if you want total availability (daily capacity) to depend on the number of selected visitors.\";i:4011;s:6:\"Single\";i:4012;s:5:\"Child\";i:4013;s:23:\"Select Booking Resource\";i:4014;s:64:\"%s - search inside posts/pages which are part of this category, \";i:4015;s:52:\"%s - search inside posts/pages which have this tag, \";i:4016;s:20:\"%s - check-in date, \";i:4017;s:21:\"%s - check-out date, \";i:4018;s:43:\"%s - default selection number of visitors, \";i:4019;s:20:\"%s - search button, \";i:4020;s:21:\"%s - resource title, \";i:4021;s:41:\"%s - link to the page with booking form, \";i:4022;s:39:\"%s - availability of booking resource, \";i:4023;s:58:\"%s - maximum number of visitors for the booking resource, \";i:4024;s:35:\"%s - cost of booking the resource, \";i:4025;s:77:\"%s - featured image, taken from the featured image associated with the post, \";i:4026;s:68:\"%s - booking info, taken from the excerpt associated with the post, \";i:4027;s:28:\"Inlinee Search Form Template\";i:4028;s:18:\"Cache will expire:\";i:4029;s:119:\"Try selecting fewer visitors. The number of visitors may be more than the number of available units on selected day(s)!\";i:4030;s:42:\"Please select check-in and check-out days!\";i:4031;s:208:\"Sorry, the reservation was not made because these days are already booked!!! %s (Its not possible to store this sequence of the dates into the one resource.) %s Please %srefresh%s the page and try other days.\";i:4032;s:44:\"The folowing pending booking(s): %s deleted.\";i:4033;s:44:\"Please type the %sTitle of search results%s.\";i:4034;s:66:\"Please type the %smessage ,what is showing, when  nothing found%s.\";i:4035;s:99:\"Please type the URL of the page %s(with %s shortcode in content)%s, where search results will show.\";i:4036;s:83:\" Check this box to display the %sdaily cost at the date cells%s in the calendar(s).\";i:4037;s:109:\"Type your %scurrency symbol%s to display near daily cost in date cells. %sDocumentation on currency symbols%s\";i:4038;s:30:\"Type your %scost%s description\";i:4039;s:124:\"For example, if the original cost of the booking is %s, then after applying additional costs the total cost will be folowing\";i:4040;s:30:\"%s, then total cost will be %s\";i:4041;s:51:\"%s, then total cost will be (if selected 3 days) %s\";i:4042;s:82:\"Please check more info about configuration of this cost settings on this %spage%s.\";i:4043;s:95:\"Show deposit payment form, only if difference between %sToday%s and %sCheck In%s days more than\";i:4044;s:84:\"Show deposit payment form, only if %sCheck In%s day inside of this %sSeason Filter%s\";i:4045;s:105:\"Cost setings at %stop have higher priority%s than other costs of same type at the %sbottom%s of the list.\";i:4046;s:104:\"Please create all %s terms firstly %s(from higher priority to lower)%s, then terms %s and after terms %s\";i:4047;s:58:\"%s and %s terms have higher priority than a range %s days.\";i:4048;s:34:\"%s - definition of check-out date.\";i:4049;s:173:\"Specific cost will take affect, only if it active (the box at the left side is checked) and if \"Check In\" (start) date belong to selected season filter or if set \"Any days\".\";i:4050;s:30:\"Standard booking resource cost\";i:4051;s:27:\"Total booking resource cost\";i:4052;s:52:\"Do you really want to delete selected booking form ?\";i:4053;s:56:\"Select a %sFIXED%s number of days with %s1 mouse click%s\";i:4054;s:58:\"Select a %sDYNAMIC%s range of days with %s2 mouse clicks%s\";i:4055;s:48:\"Type your %snumber of days for range selection%s\";i:4056;s:70:\"Select your %sminimum and maximum number of days for range selection%s\";i:4057;s:77:\"%s Important!%s This will overwrite any times selection in your booking form.\";i:4058;s:38:\"Type your %sCheck-in%s time of booking\";i:4059;s:39:\"Type your %sCheck-Out%s time of booking\";i:4060;s:80:\"Type your %stitle%s, what will show in mouseover tooltip near booked timeslot(s)\";i:4061;s:92:\"Type your time format for emails and the booking table. %sDocumentation on time formatting%s\";i:4062;s:77:\"Check this checkbox to %sactivate%s auto approve of all new pending bookings.\";i:4063;s:78:\"Check this box to %sactivate%s auto-cancellation for pending, unpaid bookings.\";i:4064;s:21:\"Cancel bookings older\";i:4065;s:64:\"Check this box to %ssend%s cancellation email for this resource.\";i:4066;s:60:\"Type the reason for %scancellation%s for the email template.\";i:4067;s:56:\"Email with  Payment Request which is sending to Visitor.\";i:4068;s:56:\"Error! Please reset your check-in/check-out dates above.\";i:4069;s:114:\"Start Time is invalid. The date or time may be booked, or already in the past! Please choose another date or time.\";i:4070;s:194:\"End Time is invalid. The date or time may be booked, or already in the past. The End Time may also be earlier that the start time, if only 1 day was selected! Please choose another date or time.\";i:4071;s:50:\"The time(s) may be booked, or already in the past!\";i:4072;s:3:\"min\";i:4073;s:40:\"Type your %sreason for payment%s request\";i:4074;s:59:\"%sYou do not have permissions for this booking resources.%s\";i:4075;s:30:\"%sNo this booking resources.%s\";i:4076;s:24:\"Default booking resource\";i:4077;s:37:\"Select your default booking resource.\";i:4078;s:25:\"Resources number per page\";i:4079;s:84:\"Select number of booking resources (single or parent) per page at Resource menu page\";i:4080;s:13:\"Booking title\";i:4081;s:11:\"admin panel\";i:4082;s:155:\"Type %sdefault title of bookings%s in calendar view mode at Booking Listing page (You can use the shortcodes from the bottom form of Settings Fields page).\";i:4083;s:11:\"front panel\";i:4084;s:142:\"Type %sdefault title of bookings%s in %stimeline at front-end side%s. You can use the shortcodes from the bottom form of Settings Fields page.\";i:4085;s:26:\"Booking details in popover\";i:4086;s:102:\"Check this box if you want to %sshow popover with booking details%s in timeline at %sfront-end%s side.\";i:4087;s:9:\"semicolon\";i:4088;s:5:\"comma\";i:4089;s:18:\"CSV data separator\";i:4090;s:52:\"Select separator of data for export bookings to CSV.\";i:4091;s:20:\"URL to edit bookings\";i:4092;s:88:\"Type URL for %svisitors%s to edit bookings. You must insert %s shortcode into this page.\";i:4093;s:41:\"Change hash after the booking is approved\";i:4094;s:139:\"Check this box if you want to change the booking hash after approval. When checked, visitor will not be able to edit or cancel the booking.\";i:4095;s:79:\"Customization of email template, which is sending after modification of booking\";i:4096;s:53:\"Email is sending to Visitor after Editing of booking.\";i:4097;s:90:\"Content of booking fields data for email templates (%s-shortcode) and booking listing page\";i:4098;s:47:\"%s - inserting data from fields of booking form\";i:4099;s:23:\"%s - inserting new line\";i:4100;s:153:\"You can use any %sHTML tags%s in the booking form. Please use the HTML tags carefully. Be sure, that all \"open\" tags (like %s) are closed (like this %s).\";i:4101;s:26:\"Wrap each item with %s tag\";i:4102;s:24:\"Put a label before field\";i:4103;s:21:\"Make it %sexclusive%s\";i:4104;s:74:\"One Value from %sOptions%s list or term %s for selection of all checkboxes\";i:4105;s:31:\"One Value from %sOptions%s list\";i:4106;s:29:\"Allow %smultiple%s selections\";i:4107;s:19:\"Set as %srequired%s\";i:4108;s:56:\"Copy and paste this shortcode into the form at left side\";i:4109;s:73:\"Put this code in %sContent of Booking Fields%s and in %sEmail Templates%s\";i:4110;s:31:\"Required Fields in Booking Form\";i:4111;s:47:\"You must to have this shortcode:%s in the form.\";i:4112;s:136:\"You can insert several calendars of different resources into the form allowing you to book several resources during one booking process.\";i:4113;s:12:\"Example: %s.\";i:4114;s:113:\"where %s – default calendar %s (you can select desired resource of calendar by inserting shortcode into page)%s\";i:4115;s:43:\"%s – calendar of booking resource with %s\";i:4116;s:46:\"Please check more about this feature %shere%s.\";i:4117;s:53:\"You can %suse this shortcode only once%s in the form.\";i:4118;s:52:\"You must have this shortcode:%s in the booking form.\";i:4119;s:45:\"Insert %s shortcode to prevent SPAM bookings.\";i:4120;s:12:\"Times Fields\";i:4121;s:49:\"Select the %s using the predefined %sTime List%s.\";i:4122;s:9:\"Time Slot\";i:4123;s:171:\"Please note, %sthe use of the time shortcode%s. If you select a date with some booked time slots, this time field will %sdisable booked times slots%s (set them as grayed).\";i:4124;s:47:\"It works only in %ssingle day selection%s mode.\";i:4125;s:94:\"Also some early versions of the IE do not support disabling of the options in the selectboxes.\";i:4126;s:92:\"Even if visitor selects the booked timeslot, system will not allow them to make the booking.\";i:4127;s:103:\"Please note, in the %sOptions list%s you can use times in military time format %s(24 Hour Time)%s only.\";i:4128;s:85:\"If you use this shortcode, %syou can not use any other time shortcodes%s in the form.\";i:4129;s:23:\"Enter %s in text field.\";i:4130;s:78:\"Please note: this field only supports military time format %s(24 Hour Time)%s.\";i:4131;s:36:\"You can also use the %s in the form.\";i:4132;s:104:\"Please note, in the %sOptions list%s you can  use times in military time format %s(24 Hour Time)%s only.\";i:4133;s:13:\"Configuration\";i:4134;s:10:\"Parameters\";i:4135;s:8:\"Examples\";i:4136;s:21:\"Week days conditions.\";i:4137;s:51:\"You can use the several values, separated by comma.\";i:4138;s:26:\"Season filters conditions.\";i:4139;s:15:\"Additional info\";i:4140;s:40:\"Enter the %sTime%s using the text field.\";i:4141;s:76:\"This field does not impact to availability (booking for the specific time) .\";i:4142;s:51:\"You can customize the country list at this file: %s\";i:4143;s:54:\"You can insert this field with default selected value.\";i:4144;s:57:\"Example: %s - %s\"United States\"%s is selected by default.\";i:4145;s:89:\"start new translation section in specific language, where %s - locale of the translation.\";i:4146;s:89:\"Booking resource type is not defined. This can be, when at the URL is wrong booking hash.\";i:4147;s:11:\"My bookings\";i:4148;s:18:\"Imported 0 events.\";i:4149;s:17:\"Unknown exception\";i:4150;s:32:\"Please select day(s) in calendar\";i:4151;s:35:\"Please fill the booking form fields\";i:4152;s:37:\"Check booking details and submit form\";i:4153;s:7:\"Summary\";i:4154;s:4:\"Long\";i:4155;s:19:\"Step by step wizard\";i:4156;s:21:\"Remove selected field\";i:4157;s:29:\"Email template has not added.\";i:4158;s:33:\"Email template added successfully\";i:4159;s:30:\"Email template does not exist.\";i:4160;s:35:\"Email template deleted successfully\";i:4161;s:166:\"Did you find this plugin useful? Please support our work by purchasing the advanced version or write an article about this plugin in your blog with a link to our site\";i:4162;s:68:\"Did you know there is available an Advanced version of this plug-in?\";i:4163;s:9:\"Read more\";i:4164;s:9:\"Check our\";i:4165;s:72:\"plugin which allow to custom sort categories and custom taxonomies terms\";i:4166;s:9:\"Check out\";i:4167;s:76:\"the easy way to completely hide your WordPress core files, theme and plugins\";i:4168;s:52:\"Use commas instead of %s to separate excluded terms.\";i:4169;s:14:\"Settings Saved\";i:4170;s:30:\"Show / Hide re-order interface\";i:4171;s:32:\"Minimum Level to use this plugin\";i:4172;s:10:\"Subscriber\";i:4173;s:11:\"Contributor\";i:4174;s:6:\"Editor\";i:4175;s:13:\"Administrator\";i:4176;s:9:\"Auto Sort\";i:4177;s:126:\"If checked, the plug-in automatically update the WordPress queries to use the new order (<b>No code update is necessarily</b>)\";i:4178;s:132:\"If only certain queries need to use the custom sort, keep this unchecked and include \'orderby\' => \'menu_order\' into query parameters\";i:4179;s:35:\"Additional Description and Examples\";i:4180;s:10:\"Admin Sort\";i:4181;s:95:\"To affect the admin interface, to see the post types per your new sort, this need to be checked\";i:4182;s:31:\"Use query ASC / DESC parameter \";i:4183;s:133:\"If the query include an Ascending or Descending order paramether, use that. If query order is set to DESC the order will be reversed.\";i:4184;s:18:\"Archive Drag&Drop \";i:4185;s:114:\"Allow sortable drag & drop functionality within default WordPress post type archive. Admin Sort need to be active.\";i:4186;s:21:\"Next / Previous Apply\";i:4187;s:55:\"Apply the sort on Next / Previous site-wide navigation.\";i:4188;s:35:\"This can also be controlled through\";i:4189;s:4:\"code\";i:4190;s:49:\"Post Types Order must be configured. Please go to\";i:4191;s:13:\"Settings Page\";i:4192;s:31:\"make the configuration and save\";i:4193;s:8:\"Re-Order\";i:4194;s:85:\"This plugin can\\\'t work without javascript, because it\\\'s use drag and drop and AJAX.\";i:4195;s:19:\"Items Order Updated\";i:4196;s:18:\"Comment discarded.\";i:4197;s:18:\"Comment not found.\";i:4198;s:137:\"This site uses Akismet to reduce spam. <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Learn how your comment data is processed</a>.\";i:4199;s:14:\"Akismet Widget\";i:4200;s:54:\"Display the number of spam comments Akismet has caught\";i:4201;s:12:\"Spam Blocked\";i:4202;s:24:\"You are connected as %s.\";i:4203;s:38:\"Your subscription for %s is cancelled.\";i:4204;s:38:\"Your subscription for %s is suspended.\";i:4205;s:38:\"Sign up with a different email address\";i:4206;s:16:\"Get your API key\";i:4207;s:72:\"<strong>Almost done</strong> - configure Akismet and say goodbye to spam\";i:4208;s:332:\"Your web host or server administrator has disabled PHP&#8217;s <code>gethostbynamel</code> function.  <strong>Akismet cannot work correctly until this is fixed.</strong>  Please contact your web host or firewall administrator and give them <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">this information about Akismet&#8217;s system requirements</a>.\";i:4209;s:163:\"Your firewall may be blocking Akismet from connecting to its API. Please contact your host and refer to <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">our guide about firewalls</a>.\";i:4210;s:100:\"We cannot process your payment. Please <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">update your payment details</a>.\";i:4211;s:104:\"Please visit your <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Akismet account page</a> to reactivate your subscription.\";i:4212;s:79:\"Please contact <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Akismet support</a> for assistance.\";i:4213;s:116:\"You can help us fight spam and upgrade your account by <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">contributing a token amount</a>.\";i:4214;s:244:\"In 2012, Akismet began using subscription plans for all accounts (even free ones). A plan has not been assigned to your account, and we&#8217;d appreciate it if you&#8217;d <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">sign into your account</a> and choose one.\";i:4215;s:84:\"Please <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">contact our support team</a> with any questions.\";i:4216;s:58:\"Would you like to <a href=\"%s\">check pending comments</a>?\";i:4217;s:167:\"The connection to akismet.com could not be established. Please refer to <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">our guide about firewalls</a> and check your server configuration.\";i:4218;s:235:\"Your Pro subscription allows the use of Akismet on only one site. Please <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">purchase additional Pro subscriptions</a> or upgrade to an Enterprise subscription that allows the use of Akismet on unlimited sites.\";i:4219;s:140:\"To continue your service, <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">upgrade to an Enterprise subscription</a>, which covers an unlimited number of sites.\";i:4220;s:177:\" Please <a href=\"%s\">enable</a> or <a href=\"%s\">disable</a> this feature. <a href=\"%s\" id=\"akismet-privacy-notice-control-notice-info-link\" target=\"_blank\">More information</a>.\";i:4221;s:61:\"A 12-character Akismet API key. Available at akismet.com/get/\";i:4222;s:115:\"If true, Akismet will automatically discard the worst spam automatically rather than putting it in the spam folder.\";i:4223;s:99:\"If true, show the number of approved comments beside each comment author in the comments list page.\";i:4224;s:76:\"The time period for which to retrieve stats. Options: 60-days, 6-months, all\";i:4225;s:20:\"Comment #%d is spam.\";i:4226;s:24:\"Comment #%d is not spam.\";i:4227;s:29:\"Failed to connect to Akismet.\";i:4228;s:33:\"Comment #%d could not be checked.\";i:4229;s:35:\"API key must be set to fetch stats.\";i:4230;s:50:\"Currently unable to fetch stats. Please try again.\";i:4231;s:36:\"Stats response could not be decoded.\";i:4232;s:15:\"Comment History\";i:4233;s:401:\"We collect information about visitors who comment on Sites that use our Akismet anti-spam service. The information we collect depends on how the User sets up Akismet for the Site, but typically includes the commenter\\\'s IP address, user agent, referrer, and Site URL (along with other information directly provided by the commenter such as their name, username, email address, and the comment itself).\";i:4234;s:17:\"Akismet Anti-Spam\";i:4235;s:15:\"Remove this URL\";i:4236;s:11:\"Removing...\";i:4237;s:11:\"URL removed\";i:4238;s:6:\"(undo)\";i:4239;s:12:\"Re-adding...\";i:4240;s:14:\"New to Akismet\";i:4241;s:47:\"Sign up for an account on %s to get an API Key.\";i:4242;s:16:\"Enter an API Key\";i:4243;s:11:\"XML Sitemap\";i:4244;s:18:\"Include taxonomies\";i:4245;s:18:\"External web pages\";i:4246;s:21:\"External XML Sitemaps\";i:4247;s:19:\"Enable XML sitemaps\";i:4248;s:15:\"Allowed domains\";i:4249;s:27:\"Additional robots.txt rules\";i:4250;s:13:\"Ping Services\";i:4251;s:89:\"XML Sitemaps are not available because of your site&#8217;s visibility settings (above).\";i:4252;s:64:\"Leave empty for automatic Priority as configured on %1$s > %2$s.\";i:4253;s:19:\"Google News Sitemap\";i:4254;s:11:\"Google News\";i:4255;s:9:\"Post type\";i:4256;s:25:\"XML Sitemap & Google News\";i:4257;s:281:\"A setting in the WordPress SEO plugin causes all date based sitemaps to redirect to the main page. Please either enable <strong>%1$s</strong> under %2$s in your SEO settings or set all <strong>%3$s</strong> options to <strong>%4$s</strong> under %5$s in your XML Sitemap settings.\";i:4258;s:8:\"Split by\";i:4259;s:19:\"Included post types\";i:4260;s:18:\"Add image tags for\";i:4261;s:15:\"Attached images\";i:4262;s:13:\"Source labels\";i:4263;s:67:\"These settings control the XML Sitemaps generated by the %s plugin.\";i:4264;s:27:\"For ping options, go to %s.\";i:4265;s:10:\"Post types\";i:4266;s:10:\"Taxonomies\";i:4267;s:12:\"Open your %s\";i:4268;s:19:\"Check for conflicts\";i:4269;s:18:\"Reset XML sitemaps\";i:4270;s:53:\"Clear all XML Sitemap & Google News Sitemap settings.\";i:4271;s:66:\"This will revert all your sitemap settings to the plugin defaults.\";i:4272;s:32:\"Exclude from Google News Sitemap\";i:4273;s:61:\"Add the full URL, including protocol (http/https) and domain.\";i:4274;s:86:\"Optionally add a priority value between 0 and 1, separated with a space after the URL.\";i:4275;s:29:\"Start each URL on a new line.\";i:4276;s:101:\"Only valid sitemaps are allowed in the Sitemap Index. Use your Google/Bing Webmaster Tools to verify!\";i:4277;s:242:\"The WordPress SEO plugin may be used in conjunction with %1$s but it is not advised to have the same feature enabled in both plugins. Please either disable the Yoast sitemap under %2$s in your SEO settings or disable the option %3$s on %4$s.\";i:4278;s:17:\"XML Sitemap Index\";i:4279;s:40:\"Limit to posts in these post categories:\";i:4280;s:48:\"Additional domains to allow in the XML Sitemaps:\";i:4281;s:22:\"Failed to delete file.\";i:4282;s:103:\"This is possibly due to insufficient rights. Please try via FTP or your hosting provider control panel.\";i:4283;s:47:\"Priority can be overridden on individual posts.\";i:4284;s:31:\"Automatic Priority calculation.\";i:4285;s:83:\"Adjusts the Priority based on factors like age, comments, sticky post or blog page.\";i:4286;s:92:\"Adjusts the Priority of each taxonomy term based on the relative number of attributed posts.\";i:4287;s:19:\"Maximum per sitemap\";i:4288;s:113:\"The absolute maximum allowed is 50.000 per sitemap. Reduce this number if you experience errors or slow sitemaps.\";i:4289;s:48:\"By default, the general %s setting will be used.\";i:4290;s:238:\"The publication name should match the name submitted on the Google News Publisher Center. If you wish to change it, please read <a href=\"https://support.google.com/news/publisher/answer/40402\" target=\"_blank\">Updated publication name</a>.\";i:4291;s:74:\"Source labels provide more information about the content of your articles.\";i:4292;s:141:\"The FactCheck label may only be applied if you publish stories with fact-checking content that\\\'s indicated by schema.org ClaimReview markup.\";i:4293;s:6:\"Google\";i:4294;s:12:\"Bing & Yahoo\";i:4295;s:77:\"These rules will not have effect when you are using a static robots.txt file.\";i:4296;s:114:\"Only add rules here when you know what you are doing, otherwise you might break search engine access to your site.\";i:4297;s:55:\"Additional web pages to append in an extra XML Sitemap:\";i:4298;s:132:\"If desired, %1$s will automatically alert search engines of your updated <a href=\"%2$s\">XML Sitemaps</a> upon each new publication.\";i:4299;s:108:\"Pings are limited to once per hour for your XML Sitemap and once per 5 minutes for your Google News Sitemap.\";i:4300;s:62:\"No taxonomies available for the currently included post types.\";i:4301;s:81:\"By default, only the domain %s as used in your WordPress site address is allowed.\";i:4302;s:452:\"This means that all URLs that use another domain (custom URLs or using a plugin like Page Links To) are filtered from the XML Sitemap. However, if you are the verified owner of other domains in your Google/Bing Webmaster Tools account, you can include these in the same sitemap. Add these domains, without protocol (http/https) each on a new line. Note that if you enter a domain with www, all URLs without it or with other subdomains will be filtered.\";i:4303;s:10:\"Contribute\";i:4304;s:222:\"If you would like to contribute and share with the rest of the WordPress community, please consider writing a quick <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Review</a> or help out with <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">Translating</a>!\";i:4305;s:138:\"For feature requests, reporting issues or contributing code, you can find and fork this plugin on <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Github</a>.\";i:4306;s:142:\"You can find instructions on the help tab above. If you still have questions, please go to the <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">Support forum</a>.\";i:4307;s:21:\"Delete selected files\";i:4308;s:45:\"Attempt to delete selected conflicting files.\";i:4309;s:38:\"File not in the list of allowed files!\";i:4310;s:16:\"Publication name\";i:4311;s:102:\"These options are provided by %1$s. For help, please go to <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">Support</a>.\";i:4312;s:68:\"All XML Sitemap & Google News settings reset to the plugin defaults.\";i:4313;s:24:\"Exclude from XML Sitemap\";i:4314;s:139:\"Custom post types that do <strong>not</strong> use the post category taxonomy cannot be included as long as any category is selected below.\";i:4315;s:13:\"File deleted.\";i:4316;s:342:\"When you are done configuring and preparing your news content and you are convinced your site adheres to the <a href=\"https://support.google.com/news/publisher/answer/40787\" target=\"_blank\">Google News guidelines</a>, go ahead and <a href=\"https://partnerdash.google.com/partnerdash/d/news\" target=\"_blank\">submit your site for inclusion</a>!\";i:4317;s:129:\"It is strongly recommended to submit your news sitemap to your Google Webmasters Tools account to monitor for warnings or errors.\";i:4318;s:77:\"Google News displays images associated with articles included in their index.\";i:4319;s:220:\"Note: Google News prefers at most one image per article in the News Sitemap. If multiple valid images are specified, the crawler will have to pick one arbitrarily. Images in News Sitemaps should be in jpeg or png format.\";i:4320;s:16:\"Read more on %s.\";i:4321;s:74:\"These settings control the Google News Sitemap generated by the %s plugin.\";i:4322;s:64:\"Additional XML Sitemaps to append to the main XML Sitemap Index:\";i:4323;s:200:\"If you wish to limit posts that will feature in your News Sitemap to certain categories, select them here. If no categories are selected, posts of all categories will be included in your News Sitemap.\";i:4324;s:30:\"Reset all XML Sitemap settings\";i:4325;s:34:\"No conflicting static files found.\";i:4326;s:10:\"Include %s\";i:4327;s:49:\"Update the Last Changed date on each new comment.\";i:4328;s:17:\"Bulk Optimization\";i:4329;s:20:\"Uploaded <br> images\";i:4330;s:24:\"Uncompressed image sizes\";i:4331;s:33:\"You can change these settings %s.\";i:4332;s:19:\"Estimated <br> cost\";i:4333;s:110:\"If you wish to compress more than <strong>%1$d %2$s</strong> a month and you are still on a free account %3$s.\";i:4334;s:78:\"If you like you can to optimize your whole library in one go with the %s page.\";i:4335;s:55:\"Start the %s to optimize the remainder of your library.\";i:4336;s:62:\"You have <strong>saved %s</strong> of your media library size.\";i:4337;s:94:\"You are on a <strong>free plan</strong> with <strong>%s compressions left</strong> this month.\";i:4338;s:5:\"Items\";i:4339;s:23:\"Filter itenms by  dates\";i:4340;s:171:\"Probably you updated your paid version of Booking Manager by free version or update process failed. You can request the new update of your paid version at %1sthis page%2s.\";i:4341;s:87:\"List events or bookings from different sources at your website with easy via .ics feeds\";i:4342;s:52:\"How to start showing events from .ics feeds (files)?\";i:4343;s:85:\"Upload .ics file via this page or simply copy URL to .ics feed from external website.\";i:4344;s:65:\"Insert into page the shortcode for listing events from .ics feed.\";i:4345;s:49:\"Read more about %sshortcode configuration here%s.\";i:4346;s:44:\"Configure different options in %sSettings%s.\";i:4347;s:54:\"Configure your predefined %sEvents Listing Template%s.\";i:4348;s:16:\"Integartion with\";i:4349;s:51:\"This plugin have native integration with %s plugin.\";i:4350;s:51:\"It can sync bookings from %s with different sources\";i:4351;s:59:\"Do you require new feature? Send your %ssuggestion%s to us.\";i:4352;s:11:\"Upload File\";i:4353;s:20:\"Imported %s bookings\";i:4354;s:11:\"00:00 Today\";i:4355;s:21:\"Start of current year\";i:4356;s:11:\"Manage Data\";i:4357;s:5:\"Files\";i:4358;s:41:\"Please deactivate previous old version of\";i:4359;s:22:\"Could not download URL\";i:4360;s:28:\"File does not contain events\";i:4361;s:63:\"All plugin data will be deleted when the plugin is deactivated.\";i:4362;s:81:\"If you want to save your plugin data, please uncheck the %s\"Delete data\"%s at the\";i:4363;s:13:\"settings page\";i:4364;s:21:\"No URL for .ics feed.\";i:4365;s:15:\"No ics url feed\";i:4366;s:37:\".ics feed contain %s events at URL %s\";i:4367;s:73:\"No any new events to import! These events was import previously, already.\";i:4368;s:23:\"Imported of %s bookings\";i:4369;s:17:\"Imported from %s \";i:4370;s:16:\"Listing Template\";i:4371;s:7:\"Listing\";i:4372;s:38:\"Event template - row for event listing\";i:4373;s:21:\"%s - date(s) of event\";i:4374;s:26:\"%s - summary info of event\";i:4375;s:16:\"%s - ID of event\";i:4376;s:25:\"%s - description of event\";i:4377;s:36:\"%s - date of event editing, creation\";i:4378;s:22:\"%s - location of event\";i:4379;s:11:\"Manage .ics\";i:4380;s:16:\"Upload .ics File\";i:4381;s:15:\"Booking Manager\";i:4382;s:23:\"Shortcode configuration\";i:4383;s:32:\"Upload .ics file and show events\";i:4384;s:3:\"Log\";i:4385;s:6:\"Submit\";i:4386;s:16:\"URL to .ics feed\";i:4387;s:18:\"Show Events (.ics)\";i:4388;s:91:\"Insert this shortcode into page for showing these events at front-end side of your website.\";i:4389;s:13:\"Item Calendar\";i:4390;s:15:\"Contact Support\";i:4391;s:26:\"%sNew feature suggestion%s\";i:4392;s:26:\"Booking Manager Shortcodes\";i:4393;s:17:\"Listing .ics feed\";i:4394;s:21:\"Import .ics feed into\";i:4395;s:24:\"URL to .ics feed or file\";i:4396;s:91:\"You can specify an optional offset from you chosen start point. The offset can be negative.\";i:4397;s:19:\"End of current week\";i:4398;s:19:\"End of current year\";i:4399;s:89:\"You can specify an optional offset from you chosen end point. The offset can be negative.\";i:4400;s:45:\"You can specify the maximum number of events.\";i:4401;s:15:\"Event condition\";i:4402;s:88:\"Show event, if all dates or only some date(s) within conditional paramters from / untill\";i:4403;s:36:\"Some date(s) in conditional interval\";i:4404;s:41:\"Strict. All dates in conditional interval\";i:4405;s:53:\"Select booking resource, where event will be imported\";i:4406;s:16:\"Import condition\";i:4407;s:81:\"Whether import events for dates, that already booked in specific booking resource\";i:4408;s:18:\"Import in any case\";i:4409;s:34:\"Import only, if days are available\";i:4410;s:91:\"Imort booking, if all dates or only some date(s) within conditional paramters from / untill\";i:4411;s:12:\"Update of %s\";i:4412;s:14:\"Delivery of %s\";i:4413;s:98:\"Hello.%sTo download %s click the link below:%s (%s) ~ Download link will expire in %sThank you, %s\";i:4414;s:90:\"Hello. %sThank you for requesting %s To download %s click the link below: %s Thank you, %s\";i:4415;s:32:\"Type your email message content.\";i:4416;s:7:\"To User\";i:4417;s:50:\"Email with download link, which is sending to user\";i:4418;s:27:\"Download notification of %s\";i:4419;s:243:\"Hello.%sThe %s have been downloaded at %s from IP: %s~ Download link of %s will expire in %s === User info ===%s User agent: %s IP: %s Request url: %s ======================%s === Product Summary ===%s %s ======================%s Thank you, %s\";i:4420;s:205:\"Hi. %s The %s have been downloaded. %s ===== User Info ===== %s To: %s IP:  %s User agent: %s Request url: %s ====================== %s ===== Product Summary ===== %s Expire at %s ====================== %s\";i:4421;s:21:\"Download Notification\";i:4422;s:60:\"Email about download notification, which is sending to admin\";i:4423;s:4:\"Misc\";i:4424;s:13:\"Miscellaneous\";i:4425;s:587:\"Contact Form 7 Polylang extension <strong>WARNING</strong>: due to the evolution of Polylang plugin, and non-WP standard coded CF7 plugin, this plugin is now an extension of the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/cf7-grid-layout/\">CF7 Smart Grid-layout</a> plugin.<br /> Please install it to get the full functionality of PolyLang in CF7 admin pages. If you choose not to install it, your existing forms will continue to work, but you will not be able to create <em>new translations</em>. More information on the plugin <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/cf7-polylang/\">page</a>.\";i:4426;s:20:\"enter your full name\";i:4427;s:19:\"enter a valid email\";i:4428;s:21:\"enter a brief message\";i:4429;s:74:\"Warning: save contact forms translation in Polylang \'.$link, \'cf7_polylang\";i:4430;s:10:\"Edit modal\";i:4431;s:68:\"Native lets you delete permanently or select another, but is heavier\";i:4432;s:13:\"Photo Gallery\";i:4433;s:17:\"Font Awesome Icon\";i:4434;s:12:\"Icon Preview\";i:4435;s:12:\"Default Icon\";i:4436;s:12:\"Icon Element\";i:4437;s:10:\"Icon Class\";i:4438;s:12:\"Icon Unicode\";i:4439;s:11:\"Icon Object\";i:4440;s:17:\"Show Icon Preview\";i:4441;s:84:\"Set to \\\'Yes\\\' to include a larger icon preview on any admin pages using this field.\";i:4442;s:20:\"Enqueue FontAwesome?\";i:4443;s:73:\"Set to \\\'Yes\\\' to enqueue FA in the footer on any pages using this field.\";i:4444;s:16:\"Cannot find icon\";i:4445;s:8:\"Child Of\";i:4446;s:8:\"Order By\";i:4447;s:10:\"Hide Empty\";i:4448;s:12:\"Hierarchical\";i:4449;s:18:\"Include Categories\";i:4450;s:18:\"Exclude Categories\";i:4451;s:11:\"Start State\";i:4452;s:19:\"Display Posts Count\";i:4453;s:22:\"Update Post Categories\";i:4454;s:20:\"Strings translations\";i:4455;s:17:\"Language Switcher\";i:4456;s:28:\"Displays a language switcher\";i:4457;s:20:\"Displays as dropdown\";i:4458;s:23:\"Displays language names\";i:4459;s:14:\"Displays flags\";i:4460;s:25:\"Forces link to front page\";i:4461;s:26:\"Hides the current language\";i:4462;s:35:\"Hides languages with no translation\";i:4463;s:18:\"WPML Compatibility\";i:4464;s:35:\"WPML compatibility mode of Polylang\";i:4465;s:11:\"Share slugs\";i:4466;s:71:\"Allows to share the same url slug across languages for posts and terms.\";i:4467;s:15:\"Translate slugs\";i:4468;s:67:\"Allows to translate custom post types and taxonomies slugs in urls.\";i:4469;s:15:\"Synchronization\";i:4470;s:183:\"The synchronization options allow to maintain exact same values (or translations in the case of taxonomies and page parent) of meta content between the translations of a post or page.\";i:4471;s:122:\"You’ve just upgraded to the latest version of Polylang! Would you like to automatically translate your website for free?\";i:4472;s:48:\"Click on Activate Lingotek to start translating.\";i:4473;s:17:\"Activate Lingotek\";i:4474;s:9:\"Activated\";i:4475;s:31:\"Automatically Translate My Site\";i:4476;s:47:\"Polylang is now fully integrated with Lingotek!\";i:4477;s:75:\"Access free machine translation for your site for up to 100,000 characters.\";i:4478;s:151:\"Machine translation is an excellent option if you\\\'re on a tight budget, looking for near-instant results, and are okay with less-than-perfect quality.\";i:4479;s:29:\"Translation Management System\";i:4480;s:71:\"Do you need to connect to a professional translation management system?\";i:4481;s:38:\"Access an online translator workbench.\";i:4482;s:77:\"Have linguists compare side-by-side versions of original and translated text.\";i:4483;s:82:\"Save and re-use previously translated material (leverage translation memory (TM)).\";i:4484;s:32:\"Professionally Translate My Site\";i:4485;s:50:\"Do you need to professionally translate your site?\";i:4486;s:60:\"Start the process of getting a professional translation bid.\";i:4487;s:142:\"Activate account so Lingotek can get an accurate count of how many words you have on your site and which languages you wish to translate into.\";i:4488;s:154:\"Once activated click on the request translation bid and a certified translation project manager will contact you to give a no obligations translation bid.\";i:4489;s:39:\"Do you need help translating your site?\";i:4490;s:64:\"Do you have existing Translation Memories you would like to use?\";i:4491;s:17:\"URL modifications\";i:4492;s:36:\"Decide how your URLs will look like.\";i:4493;s:19:\"Search translations\";i:4494;s:5:\"Media\";i:4495;s:45:\"Activate languages and translations for media\";i:4496;s:32:\"Custom post types and Taxonomies\";i:4497;s:92:\"Activate the languages and translations management for the custom post types and taxonomies.\";i:4498;s:57:\"Decide whether to remove all data when deleting Polylang.\";i:4499;s:16:\"Add new language\";i:4500;s:12:\"License keys\";i:4501;s:43:\"Manage licenses for Polylang Pro or addons.\";i:4502;s:72:\"Your license key expired on %1$s. Please %2$srenew your license key%3$s.\";i:4503;s:20:\"Netherlands Antilles\";i:4504;s:11:\"Arab league\";i:4505;s:14:\"Åland Islands\";i:4506;s:14:\"Basque Country\";i:4507;s:9:\"Catalonia\";i:4508;s:5:\"Cocos\";i:4509;s:7:\"England\";i:4510;s:9:\"Esperanto\";i:4511;s:7:\"Galicia\";i:4512;s:19:\"Republic of Ireland\";i:4513;s:9:\"Kurdistan\";i:4514;s:9:\"Occitania\";i:4515;s:5:\"Belau\";i:4516;s:6:\"Quebec\";i:4517;s:8:\"Scotland\";i:4518;s:24:\"São Tomé and Príncipe\";i:4519;s:5:\"Tibet\";i:4520;s:6:\"Veneto\";i:4521;s:28:\"United States Virgin Islands\";i:4522;s:5:\"Wales\";i:4523;s:13:\"Western Samoa\";i:4524;s:23:\"Detect browser language\";i:4525;s:84:\"When the front page is visited, set the language according to the browser preference\";i:4526;s:65:\"The chosen static front page must be translated in all languages.\";i:4527;s:17:\"Language switcher\";i:4528;s:7:\"Tagline\";i:4529;s:12:\"Widget title\";i:4530;s:11:\"Widget text\";i:4531;s:9:\"Languages\";i:4532;s:13:\"All languages\";i:4533;s:21:\"WP fancyBox3 Settings\";i:4534;s:12:\"WP fancyBox3\";i:4535;s:8:\"Previous\";i:4536;s:63:\"The requested content cannot be loaded. Please try again later.\";i:4537;s:15:\"Start slideshow\";i:4538;s:15:\"Pause slideshow\";i:4539;s:11:\"Full screen\";i:4540;s:10:\"Thumbnails\";i:4541;s:5:\"Share\";i:4542;s:21:\"Regenerate Thumbnails\";i:4543;s:10:\"Loading…\";i:4544;s:63:\"Skip regenerating existing correctly sized thumbnails (faster).\";i:4545;s:207:\"Delete thumbnail files for old unregistered sizes in order to free up server space. You risk broken images if you do this so it\'s strongly recommended that you update the content of posts to reduce the risk.\";i:4546;s:65:\"<strong>{label}:</strong> {width}×{height} pixels ({cropMethod})\";i:4547;s:89:\"<strong>{label}:</strong> {width}×{height} pixels ({cropMethod}) <code>{filename}</code>\";i:4548;s:74:\"<strong>{label}:</strong> {width}×{height} pixels <code>{filename}</code>\";i:4549;s:92:\"<strong>{label}:</strong> {width}×{height} pixels (thumbnail would be larger than original)\";i:4550;s:14:\"cropped to fit\";i:4551;s:47:\"proportionally resized to fit inside dimensions\";i:4552;s:313:\"When you change WordPress themes or change the sizes of your thumbnails at <a href=\"%s\">Settings → Media</a>, images that you have previously uploaded to you media library will be missing thumbnail files for those new image sizes. This tool will allow you to create those missing thumbnail files for all images.\";i:4553;s:281:\"To process a specific image, visit your media library and click the &quot;Regenerate Thumbnails&quot; link or button. To process multiple specific images, make sure you\\\'re in the <a href=\"%s\">list view</a> and then use the Bulk Actions dropdown after selecting one or more images.\";i:4554;s:49:\"Update the content of posts to use the new sizes.\";i:4555;s:41:\"Regenerate Thumbnails For All Attachments\";i:4556;s:59:\"Regenerate Thumbnails For All {attachmentCount} Attachments\";i:4557;s:46:\"Regenerate Thumbnails For Featured Images Only\";i:4558;s:68:\"Regenerate Thumbnails For The {attachmentCount} Featured Images Only\";i:4559;s:15:\"Thumbnail Sizes\";i:4560;s:67:\"These are all of the thumbnail sizes that are currently registered:\";i:4561;s:12:\"Alternatives\";i:4562;s:349:\"If you have <a href=\"{url-cli}\">command-line</a> access to your site\\\'s server, consider using <a href=\"{url-wpcli}\">WP-CLI</a> instead of this tool. It has a built-in <a href=\"{url-wpcli-regenerate}\">regenerate command</a> that works similarly to this tool but should be significantly faster since it has the advantage of being a command-line tool.\";i:4563;s:391:\"Another alternative is to use the <a href=\"{url-photon}\">Photon</a> functionality that comes with the <a href=\"{url-jetpack}\">Jetpack</a> plugin. It generates thumbnails on-demand using WordPress.com\\\'s infrastructure. <em>Disclaimer: The author of this plugin, Regenerate Thumbnails, is an employee of the company behind WordPress.com and Jetpack but I would recommend it even if I wasn\\\'t.\";i:4564;s:43:\"Regenerate Thumbnails: {name} — WordPress\";i:4565;s:31:\"<strong>ERROR:</strong> {error}\";i:4566;s:48:\"<code>{filename}</code> {width}×{height} pixels\";i:4567;s:7:\"Preview\";i:4568;s:74:\"Update the content of posts that use this attachment to use the new sizes.\";i:4569;s:15:\"Regenerating…\";i:4570;s:28:\"Done! Click here to go back.\";i:4571;s:18:\"Error Regenerating\";i:4572;s:82:\"There was an error regenerating this attachment. The error was: <em>{message}</em>\";i:4573;s:112:\"These are the currently registered thumbnail sizes, whether they exist for this attachment, and their filenames:\";i:4574;s:237:\"The attachment says it also has these thumbnail sizes but they are no longer in use by WordPress. You can probably safely have this plugin delete them, especially if you have this plugin update any posts that make use of this attachment.\";i:4575;s:18:\"Errors Encountered\";i:4576;s:16:\"Regeneration Log\";i:4577;s:5:\"Pause\";i:4578;s:6:\"Resume\";i:4579;s:18:\"Regenerated {name}\";i:4580;s:45:\"Skipped Attachment ID {id} ({name}): {reason}\";i:4581;s:36:\"Skipped Attachment ID {id}: {reason}\";i:4582;s:23:\"All done in {duration}.\";i:4583;s:13:\"{count} hours\";i:4584;s:15:\"{count} minutes\";i:4585;s:15:\"{count} seconds\";i:4586;s:130:\"Unable to fetch a list of attachment IDs to process from the WordPress REST API. You can check your browser\'s console for details.\";i:4587;s:53:\"Regenerate Thumbnails For The %d Selected Attachments\";i:4588;s:104:\"This plugin requires WordPress 4.7 or newer. You are on version %1$s. Please <a href=\"%2$s\">upgrade</a>.\";i:4589;s:47:\"Regenerate the thumbnails for this single image\";i:4590;s:34:\"No attachment exists with that ID.\";i:4591;s:31:\"This item is not an attachment.\";i:4592;s:81:\"This attachment is a site icon and therefore the thumbnails shouldn\'t be touched.\";i:4593;s:138:\"The fullsize image file cannot be found in your uploads directory at <code>%s</code>. Without it, new thumbnail images can\'t be generated.\";i:4594;s:23:\"TranslatePress Settings\";i:4595;s:34:\"Google API Key from settings page:\";i:4596;s:14:\"HTTP Referrer:\";i:4597;s:86:\"Use this HTTP Referrer if you want to restrict usage of the API from Google Dashboard.\";i:4598;s:9:\"Response:\";i:4599;s:14:\"Response Body:\";i:4600;s:37:\"Entire Response From wp_remote_get():\";i:4601;s:13:\"All Languages\";i:4602;s:4:\"Code\";i:4603;s:46:\"Are you sure you want to remove this language?\";i:4604;s:63:\"Select the language you wish to make your website available in.\";i:4605;s:220:\"To add <strong>more then two languages</strong> and support for SEO Title, Description, Slug and more check out <a href=\"%s\" class=\"button button-primary\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TranslatePress Pro\">TranslatePress PRO</a>\";i:4606;s:121:\"Not only you are getting extra features and premium support, you also help fund the future development of TranslatePress.\";i:4607;s:16:\"Default Language\";i:4608;s:58:\"Select the original language your website was written in. \";i:4609;s:77:\"WARNING. Changing the default language will invalidate existing translations.\";i:4610;s:87:\"Even changing from en_US to en_GB, because they are treated as two different languages.\";i:4611;s:61:\"In most cases changing the default flag is all it is needed: \";i:4612;s:24:\"replace the default flag\";i:4613;s:20:\"Native language name\";i:4614;s:112:\"Select Yes if you want languages to display in their native names. Otherwise, they will be displayed in English.\";i:4615;s:37:\"Use subdirectory for default language\";i:4616;s:206:\"Select Yes if you want to add the subdirectory in the url for the default language.</br>By selecting Yes, the default language seen by website visitors will become the first one in the \"All Languages\" list.\";i:4617;s:30:\"Force language in custom links\";i:4618;s:111:\"Select Yes if you want to force custom links without language encoding to keep the currently selected language.\";i:4619;s:16:\"Google Translate\";i:4620;s:419:\"Enable or disable the automatic translation of the site with Google Translate. Only untranslated strings will receive a translation.<br>You can later edit these automatic translations.<br>Note: Not all languages support automatic translation. Please consult the <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/languages\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Automatic translation supported languages.\">supported languages list</a>. \";i:4621;s:24:\"Google Translate API Key\";i:4622;s:208:\"Visit <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/docs/authentication/api-keys\" target=\"_blank\">this link</a> to see how you can set up an API key, <strong>control API costs</strong> and set HTTP referrer restrictions.\";i:4623;s:29:\"<br>Your HTTP referrer is: %s\";i:4624;s:10:\"Shortcode \";i:4625;s:36:\"Use shortcode on any page or widget.\";i:4626;s:9:\"Menu item\";i:4627;s:32:\"Learn more in our documentation.\";i:4628;s:27:\"Floating language selection\";i:4629;s:58:\"Have a floating dropdown following the user on every page.\";i:4630;s:6:\"Saved!\";i:4631;s:16:\"Save translation\";i:4632;s:29:\"Select string to translate...\";i:4633;s:15:\"Gettext strings\";i:4634;s:7:\"View as\";i:4635;s:10:\"Logged Out\";i:4636;s:29:\"Available in our Pro Versions\";i:4637;s:25:\"You have unsaved changes!\";i:4638;s:15:\"Original String\";i:4639;s:5:\"To %s\";i:4640;s:7:\"From %s\";i:4641;s:15:\"Discard changes\";i:4642;s:15:\"Other languages\";i:4643;s:73:\"You can add a new language from <a href=\"%s\">Settings->TranslatePress</a>\";i:4644;s:137:\"However, you can still use TranslatePress to <strong style=\"background: #f5fb9d;\">modify gettext strings</strong> available in your page.\";i:4645;s:85:\"Strings that are user created can\\\'t be modified, only those from themes and plugins.\";i:4646;s:26:\"Extra Translation Features\";i:4647;s:31:\"Support for 221 Extra Languages\";i:4648;s:17:\"Yoast SEO support\";i:4649;s:38:\"Translate SEO Title, Description, Slug\";i:4650;s:26:\"Create Translator Accounts\";i:4651;s:37:\"Publish only when translation is done\";i:4652;s:34:\"Translate by Browsing as User Role\";i:4653;s:34:\"Different Menus Items per Language\";i:4654;s:33:\"Automatic User Language Detection\";i:4655;s:24:\"Supported By Real People\";i:4656;s:13:\"Find Out More\";i:4657;s:48:\"Remove duplicate rows from TranslatePress tables\";i:4658;s:298:\"<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE: Before performing this action it is strongly recommended to backup the database first.</strong><br><br>This feature can be used to cleanup duplicate entries in TranslatePress trp_dictionary tables. Such duplicates can appear in exceptional situations of unexpected behavior.\";i:4659;s:103:\"IMPORTANT: It is strongly recommended to backup the database first!\\nAre you sure you want to continue?\";i:4660;s:10:\"Batch size\";i:4661;s:203:\"The number of rows to check at once.<br>Choosing a smaller number helps solve the 502 error \"Page took too long to respond\" on large databases.<br>May take several minutes depending on the database size.\";i:4662;s:21:\"Remove duplicate rows\";i:4663;s:182:\"You are not using a permalink structure! Please <a href=\"%s\">enable</a> one or install our <a href=\"%s\">\"Language by GET parameter\"</a> addon so TranslatePress can function properly.\";i:4664;s:18:\"Cheatin&#8217; uh?\";i:4665;s:19:\"Full Language Names\";i:4666;s:20:\"Short Language Names\";i:4667;s:30:\"Flags with Full Language Names\";i:4668;s:31:\"Flags with Short Language Names\";i:4669;s:10:\"Only Flags\";i:4670;s:33:\"Error! Duplicate Url slug values.\";i:4671;s:47:\"Limit this menu item to the following languages\";i:4672;s:192:\"The Yoast SEO Sitemaps will now contain the default language slug: example.com/en/sitemap_index.xml <br/> This works perfectly, just take it into account when you submit the sitemap to Google.\";i:4673;s:56:\"First by browser language, then IP address (recommended)\";i:4674;s:42:\"First by IP address, then browser language\";i:4675;s:24:\"Only by browser language\";i:4676;s:18:\"Only by IP address\";i:4677;s:175:\"<div class=\\\"warning\\\">WARNING. Cannot determine your language preference based on your current IP.<br>This is most likely because the website is on a local environment.</div>\";i:4678;s:23:\"Enter your license key.\";i:4679;s:28:\"Method of language detection\";i:4680;s:144:\"Select how the language should be detected for first time visitors.<br>The visitor\'s last displayed language will be remembered through cookies.\";i:4681;s:64:\"Select the languages you wish to make your website available in.\";i:4682;s:188:\"You are not using a permalink structure! Please <a href=\\\"%s\\\">enable</a> one or install our <a href=\\\"%s\\\">\\\"Language by GET parameter\\\"</a> addon so TranslatePress can function properly.\";i:4683;s:235:\"Redirect users to their preferred language based on their browser language or IP address using our new <a href=\\\"https://translatepress.com/docs/addons/automatic-user-language-detection/\\\" >Automatic User Language Detection Add-on</a>.\";i:4684;s:5:\"Done.\";i:4685;s:36:\"Back to TranslatePress Settings page\";i:4686;s:14:\"Invalid nonce.\";i:4687;s:34:\"Querying table <strong>%s</strong>\";i:4688;s:21:\"%s duplicates removed\";i:4689;s:43:\"If the page does not redirect automatically\";i:4690;s:10:\"click here\";i:4691;s:16:\"Current Language\";i:4692;s:14:\"Translate Site\";i:4693;s:7:\"License\";i:4694;s:6:\"Addons\";i:4695;s:12:\"Pro Features\";i:4696;s:9:\"Translate\";i:4697;s:30:\"Translate entire block element\";i:4698;s:45:\"Split block to translate strings individually\";i:4699;s:17:\"Translation block\";i:4700;s:63:\"Are you sure you want to split this phrase into smaller pieces?\";i:4701;s:16:\"Meta Information\";i:4702;s:11:\"String List\";i:4703;s:21:\"Dynamic Added Strings\";i:4704;s:14:\"Translate Page\";i:4705;s:14:\"Security check\";i:4706;s:8:\"OG Title\";i:4707;s:12:\"OG Site Name\";i:4708;s:14:\"OG Description\";i:4709;s:13:\"Twitter Title\";i:4710;s:19:\"Twitter Description\";i:4711;s:9:\"Post Slug\";i:4712;s:10:\"Page Title\";i:4713;s:217:\"<strong>TranslatePress</strong> requires <strong><a href=\\\"http://php.net/manual/en/book.mbstring.php\\\">Multibyte String PHP library</a></strong>. Please contact your server administrator to install it on your server.\";i:4714;s:228:\"To add <strong>more then two languages</strong> and support for SEO Title, Description, Slug and more check out <a href=\\\"%s\\\" class=\\\"button button-primary\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"TranslatePress Pro\\\">TranslatePress PRO</a>\";i:4715;s:208:\"Select Yes if you want to add the subdirectory in the url for the default language.</br>By selecting Yes, the default language seen by website visitors will become the first one in the \\\"All Languages\\\" list.\";i:4716;s:425:\"Enable or disable the automatic translation of the site with Google Translate. Only untranslated strings will receive a translation.<br>You can later edit these automatic translations.<br>Note: Not all languages support automatic translation. Please consult the <a href=\\\"https://cloud.google.com/translate/docs/languages\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" title=\\\"Automatic translation supported languages.\\\">supported languages list</a>. \";i:4717;s:12:\"Test API key\";i:4718;s:212:\"Visit <a href=\\\"https://cloud.google.com/docs/authentication/api-keys\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">this link</a> to see how you can set up an API key, <strong>control API costs</strong> and set HTTP referrer restrictions.\";i:4719;s:83:\"Go to  %1$s Appearance -> Menus%2$s to add Language Switcher Languages in any menu.\";i:4720;s:75:\"You can add a new language from <a href=\\\"%s\\\">Settings->TranslatePress</a>\";i:4721;s:139:\"However, you can still use TranslatePress to <strong style=\\\"background: #f5fb9d;\\\">modify gettext strings</strong> available in your page.\";i:4722;s:84:\"Strings that are user created can\'t be modified, only those from themes and plugins.\";i:4723;s:205:\"The number of rows to check at once.<br>Choosing a smaller number helps solve the 502 error \\\"Page took too long to respond\\\" on large databases.<br>May take several minutes depending on the database size.\";i:4724;s:24:\" TranslatePress Settings\";i:4725;s:10:\"Translator\";i:4726;s:41:\"Allow this user to translate the website.\";i:4727;s:116:\"Your PHP version is too old, please upgrade to a newer version. Your version is %1$s, Breadcrumb NavXT requires %2$s\";i:4728;s:33:\"Breadcrumb NavXT Network Settings\";i:4729;s:39:\"Adds a breadcrumb trail to your sidebar\";i:4730;s:30:\"Text to show before the trail:\";i:4731;s:16:\"Output trail as:\";i:4732;s:4:\"List\";i:4733;s:32:\"Schema.org BreadcrumbList (RDFa)\";i:4734;s:37:\"Schema.org BreadcrumbList (microdata)\";i:4735;s:5:\"Plain\";i:4736;s:20:\"Link the breadcrumbs\";i:4737;s:30:\"Reverse the order of the trail\";i:4738;s:32:\"Hide the trail on the front page\";i:4739;s:23:\"Ignore breadcrumb cache\";i:4740;s:11:\"Quick Start\";i:4741;s:7:\"Styling\";i:4742;s:19:\"Import/Export/Reset\";i:4743;s:61:\"Go to the guide on trimming breadcrumb title lengths with CSS\";i:4744;s:79:\"A collection of settings most likely to be modified are located under this tab.\";i:4745;s:34:\"Placed in between each breadcrumb.\";i:4746;s:12:\"Current Item\";i:4747;s:46:\"Place the page number breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:4748;s:89:\"Indicates that the user is on a page other than the first of a paginated archive or post.\";i:4749;s:35:\"The template for paged breadcrumbs.\";i:4750;s:15:\"Home Breadcrumb\";i:4751;s:39:\"Place the home breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:4752;s:37:\"The template for the home breadcrumb.\";i:4753;s:77:\"The template for the home breadcrumb, used when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4754;s:15:\"Blog Breadcrumb\";i:4755;s:39:\"Place the blog breadcrumb in the trail.\";i:4756;s:19:\"Mainsite Breadcrumb\";i:4757;s:71:\"Place the main site home breadcrumb in the trail in an multisite setup.\";i:4758;s:84:\"The template for the main site home breadcrumb, used only in multisite environments.\";i:4759;s:122:\"The template for the main site home breadcrumb, used only in multisite environments and when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4760;s:97:\"The settings for all post types (Posts, Pages, and Custom Post Types) are located under this tab.\";i:4761;s:10:\"Post Types\";i:4762;s:34:\"The template for post breadcrumbs.\";i:4763;s:79:\"The template for post breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4764;s:79:\"Show the hierarchy (specified below) leading to a post in the breadcrumb trail.\";i:4765;s:137:\"Use the parent of the post as the primary hierarchy, falling back to the hierarchy selected below when the parent hierarchy is exhausted.\";i:4766;s:78:\"Allow the referring page to influence the taxonomy selected for the hierarchy.\";i:4767;s:14:\"Post Hierarchy\";i:4768;s:11:\"Post Parent\";i:4769;s:5:\"Pages\";i:4770;s:34:\"The template for page breadcrumbs.\";i:4771;s:79:\"The template for page breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4772;s:11:\"Attachments\";i:4773;s:40:\"The template for attachment breadcrumbs.\";i:4774;s:85:\"The template for attachment breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4775;s:22:\"&mdash; Select &mdash;\";i:4776;s:111:\"The settings for all taxonomies (including Categories, Tags, and custom taxonomies) are located under this tab.\";i:4777;s:38:\"The template for category breadcrumbs.\";i:4778;s:83:\"The template for category breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4779;s:33:\"The template for tag breadcrumbs.\";i:4780;s:78:\"The template for tag breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4781;s:12:\"Post Formats\";i:4782;s:41:\"The template for post format breadcrumbs.\";i:4783;s:86:\"The template for post_format breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4784;s:94:\"The settings for author and date archives, searches, and 404 pages are located under this tab.\";i:4785;s:15:\"Author Archives\";i:4786;s:36:\"The template for author breadcrumbs.\";i:4787;s:81:\"The template for author breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4788;s:143:\"display_name uses the name specified in \"Display name publicly as\" under the user profile the others correspond to options in the user profile.\";i:4789;s:34:\"The template for date breadcrumbs.\";i:4790;s:79:\"The template for date breadcrumbs, used only when the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4791;s:97:\"The anchor template for search breadcrumbs, used only when the search results span several pages.\";i:4792;s:130:\"The anchor template for search breadcrumbs, used only when the search results span several pages and the breadcrumb is not linked.\";i:4793;s:33:\"The template for 404 breadcrumbs.\";i:4794;s:10:\"Deprecated\";i:4795;s:25:\"Migrate the settings now.\";i:4796;s:12:\"Migrate now.\";i:4797;s:27:\"Attempt back migration now.\";i:4798;s:26:\"Load default settings now.\";i:4799;s:13:\"Complete now.\";i:4800;s:28:\"Attempt to fix settings now.\";i:4801;s:8:\"Fix now.\";i:4802;s:22:\"Undo the options save.\";i:4803;s:4:\"Undo\";i:4804;s:24:\"Undo the options import.\";i:4805;s:23:\"Undo the options reset.\";i:4806;s:29:\"Undo the last undo operation.\";i:4807;s:67:\"adminKit::message is deprecated, use new adminkit_messages instead.\";i:4808;s:47:\"$uid must not be null if message is dismissible\";i:4809;s:3:\"404\";i:4810;s:5:\"Theme\";i:4811;s:7:\"Plugins\";i:4812;s:22:\"Polylang Theme Strings\";i:4813;s:5:\"works\";i:4814;s:39:\"Current theme polylang-strings detected\";i:4815;s:36:\"All themes polylang-strings detected\";i:4816;s:37:\"All plugins polylang-strings detected\";i:4817;s:15:\"Plugin web-page\";i:4818;s:8:\"Donation\";i:4819;s:28:\"Please, give plugin feedback\";i:4820;s:28:\"Go to strings translate page\";i:4821;s:19:\"Go to settings page\";i:4822;s:43:\"Required to install and activate the plugin\";i:4823;s:8:\"Polylang\";i:4824;s:30:\"Searching strings-translations\";i:4825;s:59:\"Include the search for native string functions of WordPress\";i:4826;s:11:\"For example\";i:4827;s:43:\"Include the search for plugins of WordPress\";i:4828;s:46:\"It may be required additional system resources\";}}', 'yes');
